<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Mbembe Osopong</book>
  <para style="h">Nnwẹr s'Akpaar-aponga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nnwẹr s'Akpaar-aponga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nnwẹr s'Akpaar-aponga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nnwẹr s'Akpaar-aponga</para>
  <para style="ip">Nnwẹr nna ikpen Nnwẹr s'Akpaar-aponga. Idik s'nnwẹr nna ide idik s'iten k'anạng p'uwa Ubinọkpaabyi kk'otekha bẹ́, abẹ ade akpaar-aponga k'Israẹl, tạma k'obo kw'Joshua tạrr akpira k'ẹtạma ch'okpe kw'avaar p'Israẹl k'okpe kw'Samuẹl ọdạbhẹ. Wa ode okpe kw'ẹkhạma ch'Israẹl kk'ọcho-kpọhkhọ utima otor echekha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi. Tạrr oseng s'ode bẹ́, wa anạng p'Israẹl kk'achekha bẹ́, abẹ m'achok echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, wa abẹ kk'nnạm akpa avạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, n'ata akpobha ekpo ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk. Wa ọnạng kw'idede n'uruk k'oche kw'ọdaakh-ẹ. Etora ch'itọhnga s'nnwẹr sẹ ide bẹ́: wạnọ, wa anạng akpa nnạm avạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi; mfa, wa Ubinọkpaabyi n'utima ẹfa ch'ukhikhenfon ọnạng bẹ irem; nttaan, wa anạng mbọ n'agạma ẹkkaana anạng Ubinọkpaabyi; nnebung, wa Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhaang ẹmạng njọ, otekha ọkkaana kw'ode ọkpaar-aponga kwabẹ. Ọnạng kw'osong ọkkẹrẹ kw'nnwẹr nna kòde, okhenka immaana-dik rạnẹ s'aJew ikkẹ bẹ́, Samuẹl wọ ọkkẹrẹ Nnwẹr kw'Akpaar-Aponga.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s1">Anạng p'Israẹl arim anạng p'Kenaan p'arikh-urik abẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />K'okpe kw'uwa Joshua kk'upua, anạng p'Israẹl abạbhọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Bạng ẹkhạma ch'amạna jọ m'ichi eden ẹta irima anạng p'Kenaan abẹ?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Wa ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhin bẹ́, “Ẹkhạma ch'Juda ẹjọ m'ichi eden; amma k'isisek nnọ ntạkha nge bẹ k'mbọhk.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Ma wọ, anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Juda abeni anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Simeọn, p'ade ayok-ofhon pabẹ p'ade Israẹl bẹ́, “Abạnga akwu atwạn mạna abẹ, amfona k'ẹkhạma ch'abẹ akhebhi anạng mạna, anta anima anạng p'Kenaan abẹ. Amạna mba m'ambạra antwạn bạnga abẹ amfona k'abạnga k'ukhukbha.” Mạnna wọ kw'anạng p'Simeọn atwạnọ bẹ abẹ afona.<verse eid="JDG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Mạnna wọ kw'anạng p'Juda ata arima ekpong njọ. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi anạng p'Juda akhema anạng p'Kenaan, ọttạra anạng p'Pẹriz. Wa abẹ afhọ anạng nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma nsen kha Bẹzẹk. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Ma wọ wa abẹ ase Adoni-Bẹzẹk kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Bẹzẹk, abạra arima abẹ, abẹ abhạkhẹ akhema anạng p'Kenaan ọttạra anạng p'Pẹriz. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Wa Adoni-Bẹzẹk ọrạbhọ, abẹ akhubh-ẹ avạkha, abẹ akpaar-ẹ nnọhna-dim s'mbọhk ọttạra s'mfhok.<verse eid="JDG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Osenga ma, Adoni-Bẹzẹk oben bẹ́, “Avaarnạng arạbh attaan ukuma jobh p'abẹ akpaar nnọhna-dim s'mbọhk ọttạra s'mfhok, kk'adang-khạbhọ adwunga k'okpokkro kwaam isekh-isek. Mantọhmma, Ubinọkpaabyi kk'aam usia k'oche kw'uwa nsi bẹ.” Wa abẹ atim-ẹ afona kha Jẹrusalẹm, ọta ope kha.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Wa ajunung p'ẹkhạma ch'Juda abạra arima anạng p'Jẹrusalẹm abẹ, akhema bẹ. Wa abẹ atim ọkkangkkang-kkro afhọ anạng p'efhondiden njọ, abẹ abạra age kwẹ ekpon.<verse eid="JDG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Ayongu ma, anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Juda asạk ata arima anạng p'Kenaan p'arukhu k'ukhubha kw'akpecho, kha Nẹgẹv, ọttạra k'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'atẹrẹ-ọtẹrẹ, k'ukhubha kw'okpebhadudon abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Wa anạng p'Juda ata arima anạng p'Kenaan p'arukhu k'Hẹbrọn (kw'uwa okpen Kiriyat-Arba) abẹ. Abẹ abạra akhema Shẹshayi, ọttạra Ahiman, ọttạra Talmayi. <verse eid="JDG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Abẹ abina ma ata arima anạng p'arukhu k'Dẹbir (kw'uwa okpen Kiriyat-Sẹphẹr) abẹ.<verse eid="JDG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Wa Kalẹb obeni bẹ́, “Ujunung kwidede kw'urim Kiriyat-Sẹphẹr abẹ, ọbạra okhem-ẹ, amma m'nạng-ẹ Aksa kw'ode uminannwa kwaam k'ọbada.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Wa Otniyẹl kw'ode ujunung-nwa kw'Kẹnaz, kw'uwa ode nnwotte kw'isạsạkhẹ kw'Kalẹb okhem ofhon ngwọ. Mạnna wọ Kalẹb ọtạk uminannwa kwẹ, Aksa ọnạng-ẹ k'ọbada.<verse eid="JDG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Wa iwu jạnẹ, Aksa ukwu okhebha Otniyẹl, ọchọhm-ẹ bẹ ọta ophyem otte kw'ẹma Aksa isisek. Masẹ Aksa ọsạk k'ẹnyạnyaang chẹ, Kalẹb ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Mbạng vọ aroru bẹ́, nsi nnạng-ọ?”<verse eid="JDG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Ma wọ Aksa ọpọhn otte bẹ́, “Yọhbh-m itta. Masẹ kk'aam isisek anạnga kha Nẹgẹv, bạra nnạng-m afobhcho.” Ma wọ Kalẹb ọnạng-ẹ afobhcho p'ibir-ibira ọttạra p'ẹrạkha-ẹrạkha.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Wa iva p'iva p'Ken, kw'ode ọnyẹ kw'Mosẹs, ọttạra anạng p'Juda abin k'Efhondiden ch'Aji, ata aruk attạra anạng p'Juda k'ukhubha kw'uminkpa, kha Nẹgẹv ọbaanga Arad.<verse eid="JDG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Wa ajunung p'ẹkhạma ch'Juda atwạnọ anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Simeọn p'ade ayok-ofhon p'Israẹl abẹ, ata arima anạng p'Kenaan p'arukhu kha Zẹphat abẹ. Abẹ adimi ofhon kw'Zẹphat kubungu. Osenga ma, abẹ ayeri ofhon ngwọ Horma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">K'eHiburu, Horma oyini ikhibha.</char></note>. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Wa anạng p'Juda abạra akhema ifhon s'Gaza, ọttạra Ashkẹlọn, ọttạra Ẹkrọn. Wa abẹ avạk efhondiden chidede ọttạra erem chẹ.<verse eid="JDG 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning ajunung p'ẹkhạma ch'Juda abẹ. Abẹ akhem efhondiden ch'ining k'okpecho, okhenka, wa abẹ anạng p'arukhu k'ipekhuma nákkia akhubh, ukwuru s'abẹ akhaam ijaar s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr s'ide mbaanga-mbaanga. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Wa abẹ atạk Hẹbrọn anạng Kalẹb, kw'uwa ukhubhu iva p'iva p'ajunung attaan p'Anak, otor k'oche kw'uwa Mosẹs kk'ochekha. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, anạng p'Jẹbus p'arukhu k'Jẹrusalẹm nákhubha; anạng p'Jẹbus atim arukhu anạng p'Benjamin abẹ tạrr ukpira chemma.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning ẹkhạma ch'Josẹph abẹ, ma wọ abẹ ata arima anạng p'Bẹtẹl abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Masẹ abẹ atọhmọ ajunung bạnọ p'ẹchọhm-fhạr ch'Josẹph bẹ́ ata abaana Bẹtẹl (kw'uwa okpen Luz), <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />abaan-ibyi mbọ ase ujunung wạnọ s'ubin kha efhondiden uyin kha, abẹ aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tibh mạna eden ch'm'ansenga anwa k'ofhon ẹtaanga, amạna mba m'ansi-ọ ẹtaam usi.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Ma wọ, ujunung nwọ utibhi bẹ eden, bẹ atima ọkkangkkaang-kkro afhọ anạng p'efondiden njọ. Okhenkha, wa abẹ ujunung nwọ ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ náfha. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Wa n'ofon kha isisek s'anạng p'Het usi efondiden ma, okpe kwẹ Luz, kw'n'ode eche ch'ibyi nnọ tạrr ukpira chemma.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Okhenkha, wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Manasẹ, anạng p'Bet-Shan, ọttạra p'Taanak, ọttạra p'Dor, ọttạra p'Ibleam, ọttạra p'Mẹgido, ọttạra ifhon s'ining ibaabha ma, nákhubha, ukwuru s'uwa anạng p'Kenaan akhạmọ bẹ́ abẹ m'aruk ma nkhạma nnọ. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />K'okpe kw'anạng p'Israẹl n'akhaam ẹfa, abẹ n'akwa anạng p'Kenaan asi ibira-tọhm. Okhenkha, wa abẹ bẹ woowong nákhubha. <verse eid="JDG 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Ephraim anạng p'Kenaan p'arukhu k'Gẹzẹr nábạra akhubh, okhenka, wa anạng p'Kenaan afon ororo aruk bẹ abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Zebulun anạng p'Kenaan p'arukhu kha Kitron ọttạra kha Nahalol nákhubha. Osenga ma, anạng p'Kenaan afon ororo aruk bẹ abẹ. Okhenkha, wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Zebulun n'atima anạng p'Kenaan asi ibira-tọhm. <verse eid="JDG 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Ashẹr anạng p'Kenaan p'arukhu kha k'Ako, ọttạra k'Sidọn, ọttạra k'Ahlab, ọttạra K'Akzib, ọttạra k'Helba, ọttạra k'Aphẹk, ọttạra k'Rohob nákhubha. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Osenga ma, anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Ashẹr afona ororo aruk anạng p'Kenaan abẹ, ukwuru s'uwa abẹ nạn bẹ nákhubha. <verse eid="JDG 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Naphtali anạng p'arukhu k'Bet-Shẹmẹsh ọttạra k'Bẹt-Anat nákhubha. Wa abẹ afon ororo aruk anạng p'Kenaan abẹ. Okhenkha, wa anạng p'Naphtali atim anạng p'Kenaan p'arukhu k'Bẹt-Shẹmẹsh, ọttạra k'Bẹt-Anat asi ibira-tọhm. <verse eid="JDG 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Wa anạng p'Amọr akpa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Dan amaana k'ukhubha kw'akpecho, abẹ anạng p'Dan ọbọhk náttia asạkha akwu k'ẹkpẹmẹ. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Wa anạng p'Amọr akhạmọ bẹ́, abẹ m'aruk k'okpecho kw'Heres, ọttạra kw'Aijalọn, ọttạra kw'Shalbim. Okhenkha, masẹ wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Joshẹph n'akhaam ẹfa, abẹ n'atima anạng p'Amọr asi ibira-tọhm. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Wa erem ch'ẹkhạma ch'Amọr etạm k'eden ch'Inạnaangẹ, eseng ẹta ittima kha Sẹla tạrr, eseng efona.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s1">Itọhmọ s'Ubinọkpaabyi iyini anạng p'Israẹl abẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Wa itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ibin kha Gilgal, ifona kha Bokim, iben bẹ́, “Amma ntim bạnga mbina k'Ijip, ntima bạnga mfona k'isisek s'uwa nchekhi bẹ́, m'nnạng ab'atte. Mben bẹ́, ‘Amma echekha ch'nkhaam bạnga abẹ mạ́nvọhkhọ. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Abạnga echekha kátạkha ọttạra anạng p'arukhu ma isisek nna. Ọkhenka, ọbaan bẹ abạnga avọhkhọ ijabyi sabẹ.’ Tạrr oseng ma, wa abạnga ntọhna saam nátạkha. Abạnga asi yạn asi oche ngwọ? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Ma o, amma kk'bạnga mbena bẹ́, ‘Amma anạng mbọ k'abạnga k'ititikha mạ́nkhubh; abẹ m'ade masẹ amma-aruapẹ anạng bạnga, ikha sabẹ m'ibạra ide masẹ oma kw'ọgbạr ọnạng bạnga.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Masẹ itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'anạng p'Israẹl idik nnọ ikpaakha phyibh, anạng mbọ agạma ẹmạng k'ẹrạng-k'ẹrạng. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Wa abẹ ayeri ibyi nnọ Bokim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">K'eHiburu, Bokim oyini ọgạma-ẹmạng.</char></note>. Abẹ afọhnọ nja ma ibyi nnọ anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abẹ akhem anạng p'Israẹl ukwuru ocho-kpọhkhọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />K'okpe kw'Joshua kk'anạng p'Israẹl obena bẹ́ abẹ abhạna, ọnạng kwidede ọbhạna, ọta ọtạkha isisek s'ide okhebh pfẹ. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />K'akpen p'Joshua phyibh, ọttạra k'okpe kw'uwa adennạng p'uwa arukhu akpen s'Joshua kk'upua, p'abạra ase udik kwidede kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'usia ọnạng anạng p'Israẹl, wa anạng p'Israẹl akpobh Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="JDG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Wa Joshua kw'ode nnwa kw'Nun, kw'ọbạra ode ọtọhmnạng kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ope s'ode icho arạbh asen ukuma jobh. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Wa abẹ anọhng-ẹ k'isisek s'ide okhebh pfẹ, k'Timnat-Sẹra, k'ukhubha kw'efhondiden ch'okpecho kw'Ephraim, k'ibira-ibira kw'okpecho kw'Gaash.<verse eid="JDG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />K'okpe kw'ọgbọ mvọ phyibh kk'upua otor ab'otte, ọgbọ ọdwạkh-ọdwạk, f'nạn Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi osong, ọttạra idik s'kk'usia ọnạng anạng p'Israẹl, n'ukwu ọmmaana. <verse eid="JDG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl asi ibyibyia-dik k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, abẹ n'akpobha ikha s'Baal. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Abẹ akpa nnạm avạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ab'otte, kw'uwa utim bẹ ubina k'Ijip. Abẹ n'attạra ayok-ọbaanga akpobha ikha sabẹ. Abẹ agbikhi idwạdwạkhọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />ukwuru bẹ́, abẹ akpa nnạm avạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, n'akpobha ikha s'Baal ọttạra s'Ashtọrẹt. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oseng k'idwạdwạkhọ, otte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk ọnạng awawuna-nạng akhema bẹ. Okpe bẹ ọnạng awawuna-nạng abaabha bẹ age ngekha, p'abẹma oyeni nạn adạkhẹ bẹ nákkia akhubh. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Okpe kwidede kw'anạng p'Israẹl ata ekpong, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'otte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk, ayok akhema bẹ, otor k'echekha ch'kk'ọtạkha. Wa anạng p'Israẹl n'aning k'dạma-dạma kwididen.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ anạng p'Israẹl akpaar-aponga, p'akkaan arạbha bẹ k'mbọhk s'anạng p'achi bẹ k'ekpong. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Tạrr oseng ma, wa anạng mbọ akpaar-aponga pabẹ itọhng nákhọhma. Okhenkha, abẹ n'asenga akpaanga k'ikha s'anạng mbọ masẹ asaasa, n'akpobha sẹ. Wa anạng p'Israẹl agim-ugim akpa nnạm avạra immaana-dik s'abotte, p'uwa asạk echo anạng akpebhi p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />K'okpe kwidede kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi ọnạng ọkpaar-aponga, n'uninga ọkpaar-aponga nwọ abẹ, ọkkaana ọrạbha bẹ k'mbọhk s'awawuna-nạng pabẹ tạrr, ukpira k'ebowu ch'ọkpaar-aponga nwọ. Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọyaang idwạdwạkhọ sẹ ọjẹ, ukwuru ẹmạng ch'anạng p'Israẹl agạm k'irem s'awawuna-nang pabẹ n'anạng bẹ. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Okhenkha, ode ọkpaar-aponga nwọ ope, anạng p'Israẹl m'akpa adạkhẹ nnạm k'ẹmmaana ch'ipyibhi ẹyọhnga ch'ab'otte pabẹ, ata akpobha ikha, abạra atwunga echo anạng sẹ. Wa abẹ ifor nádia bẹ́, akpa nnạm avạra abyibyia-kpen ọttạra ochokpọhkhọ kwabẹ.<verse eid="JDG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọdwạkhẹ mororo otena anạng p'Israẹl, oben bẹ́, “Ukwuru s'ẹkhạma nja kk'echekha ch'kk'ndia nnạng ab'otte avọhkha, ọttạra s'abẹ nạn itọhng nákhọhma anạng-m, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />amma dạkhẹ idifhon s'Joshua ope urik s'ining bẹ k'ititikha mạ́mbuk. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Amma m'ntima idifhon nnọ nnyoma anạng p'Israẹl, ọfha nse de abẹ m'akke-okke aruk ator k'eden ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, k'oche kw'uwa ab'otte arukhu.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi otte idifhon nnọ ọbọhk ininga, sẹ okpe gwạnọ núbukha, s'uwa nạn sẹ ọbọhk núttia ọnạng Joshua.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Mama wọ ode idifhon s'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi otte ọbọhk ininga, ọfha utima oyoma anạng p'Israẹl phyibh, p'uwa nạn ekpong jạnẹ-jạnẹ k'ẹkhạma ch'Kenaan tạm nárima. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />(Wa usi oche ngwọ ọfha utima ma okpebhi iva p'iva p'anạng p'Israẹl udik otena k'ekpong, p'uwa nạn udik kw'ekpong asong): <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />wa idifhon nnọ ide avaar asen p'Philistiya, ọttạra anạng p'Kenaan phyi-phyibh, ọttạra anạng p'Sidọn, ọttạra anạng p'Hiv p'arukhu kha akpecho p'Lebanọn, tạma k'akpecho p'Baal-Hermọn tạrr akpira k'Lebo-Hamat. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Wa otte idifhon nnọ ọbọhk ininga k'oche kw'm'utima oyoma anạng p'Israẹl, ọfha ose ode abẹ s'm'achok ntọhna s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi s'uwa kk'osenga k'Mosẹs ọnạng ab'otte.<verse eid="JDG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl arukhu attạra anạng p'Kenaan, ọttạra anạng p'Het, ọttạra anạng p'Amọr, ọttạra p'Pẹriz, ọttạra anạng p'Hiv, ọttạra anạng p'Jẹbus. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Wa anạng p'idifhon nnọ atạk aminava p'Israẹl k'ọbada, abẹ abạra atạkha aminava pabẹ anạng ajunung p'Israẹl, abẹ abạra akpobha ikha s'idifhon nnọ.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otniyẹl ode ọkpaar aponga kw'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl asi ibyibyia-dik k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi; abẹ abonu Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabẹ ata akpobha akpatava p'Baal ọttạra mkpọmmachi s'Ashẹra. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Ettem ipyibhi Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi otena anạng p'Israẹl, osenga ma okpe bẹ ọnạng ọvaarnạng kw'Kushan-Rishatayim kw'ubin Aram-Naharayim, kw'anạng p'Israẹl asi ibira-tọhm anạng icho isenọttaan. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Okhenkha, masẹ abẹ agạm ẹkkaana anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ bẹ ọkkaana kw'okpen Otniyẹl, kw'ode nnwa kw'Kẹnaz, kw'ode nwotte kw'isạsạkhẹ kw'Kalẹb. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Wa Iguguma s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ẹsạk ẹnwẹ-ẹ, n'ukwu ode ọkpaar-aponga kw'Israẹl. Wa ọta urima ekpong ọvaar Kushan-Rishatayim kw'ubin Aram abẹ. Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkkaan Otniyẹl, okhem-ẹ. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Ma wọ isisek nnọ ikhaam ẹmẹm k'icho arạbh afa, tạrr ukpira k'okpe kw'Otniyẹl kw'ode nnwa kw'Kẹnaz ope.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehud ode ọkpaar aponga kw'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl abạra asi ibyibyia-dik k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ukwuru ibyibyia njọ ch'abẹ asi, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ ọvaar Eglọn kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Moab ẹfa okhema anạng p'Israẹl. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Wa Eglọn obeni anạng p'Ammọn ọttạra anạng p'Amalẹk bẹ́, abẹ akwu attạr-ẹ ata arima anạng p'Israẹl abẹ. Wa abẹ atạk Efhondiden ch'Aji.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Efhondiden ch'Aji ode Jeriko.</char></note> <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl aning k'isekh-isek kw'ẹfa ch'Eglọn kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Moab k'icho chikhanttaan.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl abạra agạma ayeri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ bẹ Ehud kw'usi ubhiribọhk, ode ọkkaana kwabẹ. Ehud wa ode nnwa kw'Gẹra kw'ubin k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin. Wa anạng p'Israẹl atọhmọ Ehud bẹ́, okkena ọvaar Eglọn kw'Moab ntum. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Wa Ehud kk'ọkkangkkang-kkro kw'ọjaabhẹ nnạm mfa usia, kw'adum pẹ akpir ọttọhk masẹ ẹtwạkhọ jạnẹ. Ọtạkha wẹ ọdạbh k'udim-kpok k'ekpo py'oge k'ifor. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Ọtạkha ntum nnọ ọnạng ọvaar Eglọn kw'Moab, kw'uwa ode ọnạng kw'ọbạrẹ ẹfa mororo. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />K'okpe kw'Ehud kk'oyok ntum nnọ ọnạnga, oben anạng p'wạra atọhk ntum nnọ bẹ́, abẹ abhạna. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Okhenkha, masẹ abẹ akpir k'akpatava p'abẹ atim nta agwa ọbaanga k'Gilgal, Ehud oyeni okkeri ma, ọkpa nnạm okhebha Eglọn, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaarnạng o, amma nkhaam ẹkkaabha idubha-idubha ch'n'mben bẹ́, mkpaakh-ọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Ma wọ ọvaarnạng obeni atọhmnạng pẹ bẹ́, “Arik mạna ẹbhaang!” Mạnna wọ abẹ abin afona.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Ma wọ Ehud oseng okhebha Eglọn kha ibyi s'uning ẹyạr mạnkkeni kha ẹnyạng ch'ọvaarter kwẹ, oben bẹ́, “Amma ntim ẹkkaabha ch'Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, nkken-ọ e.” Masẹ ọvaarnạng ubin kha ibyi s'uning ẹyạr, <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />ma wọ Ehud utim ọkwabọhk kwẹ ọtwạr ọkkangkkang-kkro kw'ọdạbhẹ k'okpok. Utima wẹ ukhum ọvaarnạng k'ẹfhạr. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Tạrr oseng s'nter s'ọkkangkkang-kkro nwọ inwẹ-ẹ k'ẹfhạr, tạrr afhạrọ pẹ amạnọ ayin, wa Ehud ọkkangkkang-kkro nwọ nọ́rạbha. Ma wọ iyaak ibubh ọkkangkkang-kkro nwọ. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Wa Ehud osengi uyin k'iyaan, ọtạkha ammakhubh p'ẹmaanggọ njọ ch'ẹnyạng ọkpạkha.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Masẹ Ehud kk'osenga ofona, ma wọ atọhmnạng p'ọvaarnạng avur ata ase bẹ́ ammakhubh p'ẹmaanggọ ch'ẹnyạng kk'akpạkha. Abẹ n'abeni bẹ́, “Nse bẹ́, ọtạ okwokha ọyọhng kha ẹmaanggọ ch'ẹtaanga-ẹtaanga ch'ọvaar-chọhm.” <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Wa abẹ aning atik tạrr, eden ibhir. Okhenkha, ọvaarnạng ammakhubh p'ẹmaanggọ njọ núgwunga. Abẹ atạkha ọgbạkhọrọ agwunga ammakhubh mbọ. Ma wọ abẹ n'ase bẹ́ aro kwabẹ kk'uttia kha ọgbaarẹ, ope.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Masẹ abẹ n'aninga ma atik, Ehud ọrạbh ofona. Wa osengi k'ukhubha kw'akpatava p'abẹ atim nta agwa, ọrạbh ofona kha Seira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Masẹ ukpir kha, oge ubukpọhng k'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Ephraim. Wa Ehud utim anạng p'Israẹl eden, abẹ aseng asạkha k'ukhubha kw'akpecho.<verse eid="JDG 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Ehud obeni bẹ́, “Ator-m nnạm, khiri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'anạng p'Moab, p'ade awawuna-nạng pabạnga, ọtạkha oge bạnga k'mbọhk.” Mạnna wọ wa abẹ ator-ẹ nnạm asạkha, ata atạkha ukhubha kw'igbin-igbin kw'Ọraanga kw'Jọrdan, kw'oten k'Moab. Abẹ ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ ọbọhk náttia ojekha. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Wa ma okpe ngwọ, abẹ afhọ anạng p'Moab p'akpir nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma nsen. Wa akkemkpa ọttạra afanạng phyi-phyibh, ọnạng kw'ọnnaang kòde. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Tạma ma iwu njọ, anạng p'Moab n'aning k'isekhisek kw'ẹfa ch'anạng p'Israẹl. Wa ẹkhạma ch'Israẹl ining k'ẹmẹm k'icho arạbh annebung.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shamgar ode ọkpaar- aponga kw'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Masẹ okpe kw'Ehud kk'osenga, Shamgar kw'ode nnwa kw'Anat, kw'ọbạra ode ọnạng kw'utim ukwurachi kw'utik-mmaam, ọfhọ anạng p'Philistiya p'akpir ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh. Wa ẹma Shamgar, ọgba ọkkaana anạng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s1">Debọra ode ọkpaar-aponga kw'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />K'okpe kw'Ehud kk'upua, wa anạng p'Israẹl abạra asi ibyibyia-dik k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Ma wọ, wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi okpe bẹ ọnạng ọvaar Jabin, kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'ẹkhạma ch'Kenaan, kw'ọdạbhẹ Hazọr. Wa Sisẹra kw'ode ochonạng kw'arim-mkpong p'Jabin, urukhu k'Haroshẹt-Hagoyim. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Wa Jabin ọkhaam ijaar s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr s'abẹ atim mbaanga asi, nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh asen, p'kk'utima usi anạng p'Israẹl igbaan k'icho ẹrạbh. Osenga ma, anạng p'Israẹl agạma aror ẹkkaana k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Ma okpe ngwọ, wa Debọra kw'ode usi-ẹyaakha, kw'ọbạra ode ikwanạng kw'Lapidot wọ n'ọkpaara aponga p'anạng p'Israẹl. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Wa n'uninga k'Uji kw'Debọra, kw'obe k'ottemkwẹ kw'Rama ọttạra Bẹtẹl, k'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Ephraim, n'ọttọhnọ aponga. Wa anạng p'Israẹl phyibh n'ata akhebh-ẹ ma bẹ́, ọttọhnọ aponga ọnạng bẹ. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Wa ọtọhmọ abẹ ayeri Barak kw'ode nnwa kw'Abinoam kw'ubin Kadẹsh k'ẹkhạma ch'Naphtali, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl ọnạng-ọ ẹfa bẹ́: ‘Sọhng k'Naphtali ọttạra k'Zebulun, ata atạkha ajunung nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma nsen, atima bẹ eden abạnga avura okpecho kw'Tabọr. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Amma m'ntima Sisẹra kw'ode ochonạng kw'arim-ekpong p'Jabin eden, ọttạra ijaar sẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra arim-ekpong pẹ, afona kha Ọraanga kw'Kishọn, ntạkha bẹ ngiọ-ọ k'mbọhk.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Osenga ma, Barak oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ode atwạn abamẹ, amma m'nta-ọta; okhenka, ode nạn abamẹ nátwạna, amma mạ́nta.”<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debọra ubhina bẹ́, “K'udik-ọkka, amma m'ntwạn abọ ọtwạn. Okhenkha, ukwuru ukhira kw'n'atima ator udik ngwa, ẹbạra mákhaama, s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'otte Sisẹra ọbọhk ikwanạng okhem-ẹ.” <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Mạnna wọ Barak otobh ajunung p'Zebulun ọttạra p'Naphtali, anạng nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma nsen p'aning k'isekh-isek kw'ẹfa chẹ. Wa Debọra ọtwạnọ abẹ.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Ma okpe ngwọ, wa Heber kw'ubin Ken kk'ubina urik ayok-ofhon p'Ken, p'ade iva p'iva p'Hobab kw'uwa ode ọnyẹ kw'Mosẹs, ọta uttima ukkira kwẹ ọbaanga ichi ch'ididen kha Zaananim kw'ọbaang Kadẹsh.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Masẹ abẹ n'akpaakhẹ Sisẹra bẹ́ Barak kw'ode nnwa kw'Abinoam kk'okpecho kw'Tabọr uvura, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisẹra ọtạkha ajunung pẹ phyibh ukwu ọttạra k'ijaar sẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr py'abẹ atim mbaanga asi, nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh asen otobha, tạma k'Haroshẹt-Hagoyim tạrr ukpira k'Ọraanga kw'Kishọn.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Mạnna wọ Debọra obeni Barak bẹ́, “Ọma sọhng! Chemma wọ ode iwu ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Sisẹra ọtạkha oge ọma Barak k'mbọhk. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi sạng kw'kk'abọ ọtwạna?” Wa Barak utim ajunung nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma nsen p'atwạnọ abẹ avura k'okpecho kw'Tabọr. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Masẹ Barak n'osenga ukwu, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi osenga k'ọkkạkkaang-kkro kw'Barak, ukhubh Sisẹra ọttạra ijaar sẹ phyibh s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra arim-ekpong pẹ tạrr, Sisẹra ọsạkha k'ọkpaar kwẹ kw'ẹnyạnyaang n'ẹtwạr, n'utima mfhok ọrạbh.<verse eid="JDG 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Wa Barak ukhubhu ijaar nnọ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr ọttạra arim-ekpong tạrr, ukpira kha Haroshẹt-Hagoyim. Arim-ekpong p'Sisẹra phyi-phyibh ape k'ọkkangkkang-kkro, ujunung wạnọ-wạnọ núrikha. <verse eid="JDG 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Wa Sisẹra ọrạbhọ k'mfhok tạrr, ọta ukpira k'ukkira kw'Jayẹl, kw'ode ikwanạng kw'Heber kw'ubin Ken, ukwuru s'uwa Jabin kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Hazọr, ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr ch'Heber kw'ubin Ken akhaam echekha ch'ẹmẹm.<verse eid="JDG 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Wa Jayẹl uyini k'iyaan ọta okhebha Sisẹra oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Attite kwaam, kwu e, nwa kha etaanga. Tte nạng-ọ ojor.” Mạnna wọ kw'ọnwa k'ukkira kw'Jayẹl, Jayẹl o, ọtạkha ẹnọhmma-kpa ububh-ẹ.<verse eid="JDG 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisẹra n'obeni bẹ́, “Asi adaakh-m o.” Mạnna wọ Jayẹl owong ẹkpa ch'abasi ch'abẹ atim atenkpa asi, ọkhaabha ọnạng-ẹ, ogwo, ọbạra ububh-ẹ.<verse eid="JDG 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sisẹra oben Jayẹl bẹ́, “Be ma ukkira-mma. De ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ ukwu ọbạbhọ de ọnạng uning mama, ben bẹ́, ‘Mma o.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Okhenkha, wa Jayẹl kw'ode ikwanạng kw'Heber ọtạk oyoma-chi wạnọ kw'ukkira, ọttạra ọtabọhk, ọbẹkh-ọbẹk ọta okhebha Sisẹra kha s'kkẹ-ẹ ọkhọhna uyima ọttaabha. Ọtạkha ubhina nwọ, ukhum-ẹ k'ochobem ọmaana k'isisek, ope.<verse eid="JDG 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Ma ibua-ibua, Barak kw'n'ukhubh Sisẹra ukpira. Mạnna wọ Jayẹl uyini k'iyaan ọta okhebh-ẹ, oben bẹ́, “Kwu, ntibh-ọ ọnạng kw'n'aror.” Ma wọ, Barak ọtwạnọ abẹ ọnwa k'ukkira, ọta ose s'Sisẹra n'uyim ububukhu kha, ubhina awẹ kw'ukhum-ẹ udwu k'ochobem.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Ma iwu njọ, anạng p'Israẹl ase oche kw'Ubinọkpaabyi okhem ọvaar Jabin kw'Kenaan. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl afon ororo akhaama ẹfa arima ọvaar Jabin kw'Kenaan abẹ tạrr, abẹ adim-ẹ.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s1">Emạng ch'ekhema ch'Debọra ọttạra Barak akkọhnọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Ma iwu njọ ch'ekpong ẹsa, Debọra ọttạra Barak kw'ode nnwa kw'Abinoam akkọhnọ emạng nja:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />“K'okpe kw'ade echo ade atim-eden k'Israẹl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">k'okpe kw'anạng atte ifor sabẹ ọbọhk anạng k'ekpong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">atọhnga Ọvaar Ubinọkpabyi!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />“Avaar o, abạnga abhaanga udik ngwa e!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Adạbhẹ o, abạnga akhọhmọ itọhng e!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">Amma, amma oyeni ẹwọ m'nkkọhn ẹmạng nnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Amma m'ntima ọkkọhna ntọhnga Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />“O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, masẹ abin kha akpecho p'Seir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">masẹ abin k'ẹkhạma ch'Edom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">isisek inyengi, ọrạngkpakpa otebh asi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">ebona ẹbạra isi ipọhrọ.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Akpecho anyengi k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, tạrr oseng k'Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">enyengi k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl,<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />“K'okpe kw'Shamgar kw'ode nnwa kw'Anat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">ọttạra k'okpe kw'Jayẹl, wa anạng dạkhẹ osenga k'náta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">wa anạng n'ata aseng kha ẹkhạbha-khạbha-den.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Akkemkpa aworu-owor k'Israẹl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">tạrr, amma Debọra ntạkha ẹfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">nkkeri anạng p'Israẹl masẹ ọkka okkeri iva.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Ubinọkpaabyi otek adecho abhapẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">k'okpe kw'ekpong ikpir k'mbaakha-mma s'efhon-diden,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">ọkhọhnkpa wạnọ-wạnọ tạrr, oseng k'ọkhọhn f'ọnạng ose k'ichen kòde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">k'ikhaana s'arim-mkpong nnọhna arạbh asen k'Israẹl.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Ettem chaam ining adecho p'Israẹl abẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">ọttạra anạng p'acher bẹ́, atte ifor sabẹ ọbọhk k'ikhaana s'anạng p'Israẹl.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">Ẹtọhnga iyim ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Abạnga ma p'ayaarẹ k'nyạnyaang-wuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">abạnga ma p'aning ẹyạr k'nnọhmakpa ikkasẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">ọttạra abạnga ma ayok p'aseng k'mfhok, akhọhmọ itọhng<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />k'ẹmạng ch'akkọhnọ-ẹmạng akkọhnọ k'asipe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">Abẹ n'akpaak nkhema s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">abẹ n'akpaak nkhema s'itor-otor k'ifhon s'anạng p'Israẹl.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">“Anạng p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">abin asạkha k'mbaakhamma s'efhon-diden, aben bẹ́,<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />‘Bina be, bina be, Debọra!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Bina be, bina be, atima mạna akkọhn ẹmạng ch'ekhema!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Barak, bina!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Ọma nnwa kw'Abinoam o, tạkha awawuna-nạng pọ p'avạk k'ẹmmạri e.’<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />“Adecho p'arikhi-urik asạk, akwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">anạng p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi asạk, akwu akhebh-m bẹ́, anta annima afanạng abẹ.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Ayok bạnọ abin k'ẹkhạma ch'Ephraim, kw'immaanabyi sabẹ ining k'Amalẹk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">anạng p'Bẹnjamin attạr k'ikhaana s'anạng p'atwạnọ abọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Adecho p'arim-ekpong abin kha Makir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">anạng p'atim ẹvaar-chi ch'odecho kw'arim-ekpong abina kha Zebulun.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Wa adecho p'Isaaka aning ator Debọra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">k'udik ọkka, Isaaka otoru Barak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">kw'abẹ atọhmọ bẹ́, ukhubh-ẹ ukpira k'ipekhuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Okhenkha, k'nkhạma s'Reubẹn, nkka isaabhẹ bẹ iseng eden.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Abạnga aseng yạn attạra k'ikhaana s'avu-kpokha bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">abạnga abhaanga eyera ch'arạkhạmaan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">K'nkhạma s'Reubẹn, nkka isaabhẹ bẹ iseng eden.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Anạng p'Gilead aning kha Jọrdan ukhubha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">Anạng p'Dan asi yạn aninga k'ọraanga ọkhaan-ọkhaan o?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Anạng p'Ashẹr akpong k'ẹraangamma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">aninga k'abẹ k'ẹkha.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Anạng p'Zebulun age akpen p'abẹ ma oyeni k'eboden, k'akpong-chen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:18">mạnna wọ kw'anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Naphtali abạra age akpen pabẹ k'eboden, k'akpong-chen.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Avaar akwu, abẹ arima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">avaar p'Kenaan arima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">kha Taanak ọbaanga mfhobh s'Megido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">okhenka, abẹ silva wạnọ-wạnọ nátạkha.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Ndudoru ining k'ọrạngkpakpa n'irima irima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:20">masẹ asẹ n'isenga k'ọrạngkpakpa, asẹ n'irima Sisẹra abẹ.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Ọraanga kw'Kishọn ofhobhu bẹ abẹ ofona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">abokhada p'ọraanga kw'Kishọn abubhu bẹ, atwạrọ bẹ phyi-phyibh atima afona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">Ọkpakpa kwaam, kpọhkhọ ifor fona ororo!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Ntwạkhọ s'nnyạnyaang n'immun k'isisek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:22">nnyạnyaang s'Sisẹra s'ẹfa idwukh-udwukha.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ibeni bẹ́, ‘M'upyibh ọnạng Meroz.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">‘M'upyibh ọnạng anạng p'Meroz kidam-kidam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">ukwuru s'uwa abẹ nạn Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi náttạra arima Sisẹra abẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">abẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi náttạra arima awawunanạng p'ẹfa abẹ.’<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />“Ijibha ch'Jayẹl ẹbạrẹ ẹyọhnga ch'ayok-ipanạng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">Jayẹl kw'ode ikwanạng kw'Heber kw'ubin Ken,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">ijibha chẹ ẹbạrẹ ẹyọhnga ch'ipanạng p'arukhu k'ukkira.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisẹra ophyem-ẹ asi, Jayẹl ọnạng-ẹ abasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">utim nkkọbh kw'ọbaan avaar ọnạng-ẹ abasi p'amaang-ọmaang.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Jayẹl onemi ọbọhk ọtạkha ubhina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">utima udimbọhk udira ọtabọhk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">utima ukhum Sisẹra, ọvọhkh-ẹ echo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">ummun-ẹ k'ochobem, udwu ukhubha, ọchẹkh-ẹ <char style="it">bẹ́ chẹk-chẹk-chẹk</char>.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisẹra ubikhi otto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">uyima Jayẹl ma k'ntwạkhọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:27">otto uyima Jayẹl ma k'ntwạkhọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">okponga ma s'otto, ope.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />“Ọkka kw'Sisẹra obe k'ufhum-ma n'umyinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">uninga k'ufhum-mma nnạm-nnạm n'ọgạma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">‘Ode yạn kw'ijaar sẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr ikpeni kwukwuna ẹkpa nja o?’<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Oyokh-umina kwẹ wạnọ kw'osong udik ubhin-ẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:29">k'udik ọkka, n'ọbạra oben ifor sẹ bẹ́,<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />‘Nse bẹ́, abẹ n'agwọhngọ ekpo py'abẹ achi k'ekpong, akhebh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">ikwanạng wạnọ oyongu ma ẹfa k'ujunung kwidede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">abẹ n'akhebh ekpo masẹ anọhma-baba akkapyẹ py'abẹ achi k'ekpong anạng Sisẹra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">anọhma-baba akkapyẹ afa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">idik nna phyibh ide s'ekpong.<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />“O Ovaar Ubinọkpaabyi, tte awaawuna-nạng pọ phyibh adimi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">Okhenkha, tte anạng p'adaakhẹ amaanẹ masẹ ekkekhạra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">k'okpe kw'achẹ iyini k'ẹfa chẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Mạnna wọ kw'uwa ẹkhạma njọ ẹkhaam ẹmẹm k'icho arạbh afa.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s1">Anạng p'Midiyan achokhu anạng p'Israẹl k'irem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl abạra asi ibyibyia-dik k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, Ubinọkpaabyi otte bẹ ọbọhk ọnạng anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Midiyan, k'icho isenọfa. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Masẹ wa anạng p'Midiyan akhaam ẹfa ayọhnga anạng p'Israẹl, anạng p'Israẹl abin ata asi ibyirukhasẹ sabẹ k'akpecho k'ẹrạng, ọttạra k'atakpamma, ọttạra k'ibyi s'ittubh-uttubha. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Okpe kw'idede kw'anạng p'Israẹl atubhu iwonu sabẹ, anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Midiyan, ọttạra ch'Amalẹk, ọttạra anạng p'nkhạma s'irukhu k'ukhubha kw'okpebha-dudon, n'afona ata arima anạng p'Israẹl abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Anạng mbọ n'abhing mạma akhibhi bẹ iwonu tạrr, akpira Gaza, abẹ anạng p'Israẹl ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ f'urukhu akpen, ọbạra ode arạkhạmaan, ọbạra ode ẹbhaam, tạrr oseng k'ẹnyạnyaang, nárikha. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Wa abẹ abin attạra itirakpo pyabẹ, ọttạra akkira pyabẹ k'ọsaabh masẹ agwurubhebhe. Wa abẹ ajunung ọttạra akamẹl pyabẹ kákkẹ abhik; abẹ achi ẹkhạma njọ, abạra akhibhi ọttọhk f'idede f'uning mạma. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Midiyan achokhu anạng p'Israẹl k'irem s'okwo tạrr, anạng p'Israẹl agạma ẹkkaana anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />K'okpe kw'anạng p'Israẹl agạm ẹkkaana anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ukwuru irem s'anạng p'Midiyan achokhu bẹ, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />ọtọhmọ usi-ẹyaakha ọnạng bẹ, kw'obeni bẹ́, “Mama wọ ode udik kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl obeni, bẹ́: Amma ntima bạnga mbina K'Ijip k'ẹkhạma njọ ch'abạnga aning k'irem. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Amma nnengi bạnga k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Ijip, ọttạra k'mbọhk s'anạng phyibh p'achokhu bạnga k'irem, mbạra mbuk bẹ k'ititikha sabạnga, mmạkhẹ ntạkha isisek sabẹ nnạng bạnga. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Mbeni bạnga bẹ́, ‘Amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga; abạnga ikha s'anạng p'Amọr p'abạnga arukhu k'isisek sabẹ kákpobha.’ Okhenkha, abạnga khaam nábhaanga.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Wa, k'iwu jạnẹ, itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ibin kha ikwu ikpira k'ofhon kw'Ọphra, ọta uninga ẹyạr k'ichi-rin ch'oak ch'Joash kw'ubin Abiez ọkhaam, k'ibyi s'nnwa kw'Gideọn n'uninga okhok agwu, k'ibyi s'abẹ n'amyạna achidwuk, ọfha anạng p'Midiyan nạngẹ bẹ ase. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Masẹ itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi iyini ikhebha Gideọn, oben bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning abọ, ọma urim-ekpong kwididen.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Okhenkha, Gideọn ubhin bẹ́, “Ode Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning mạna abẹ, ode yạn kw'idik nna phyibh n'itto ikhebha mạna o? Ikkukkona-dik sẹ phyibh s'uwa ab'otte pamạna n'akpaak atenẹ-ẹ, aben bẹ́, ‘Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi mạna nútima ubina k'Ijip o?’. Okhenkha, mantọhmma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'nnạm ọkpa ọvạra mạna, ọbạra ọtạkha mạna oge k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Midiyan.”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhạkhẹ okkeri, oben bẹ́, “Ọma sọhng, ata atima ẹfa ch'akhaam akkaana anạng p'Israẹl k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Midiyan. Amma k'akhaam k'oyeni k'ifor wọ ntọhm-ọ.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Okhenkha, Gideọn ọbạbhọ bẹ́, “Aro, amma m'nsenga yạn nkkaana anạng p'Israẹl o? Efonamma chaam ẹjọ ẹsạk ọtạm k'ẹkhạma ch'Manasẹ. Amma wọ mbạra nsạkha ọtạm k'ẹchọhmfạr ch'otte kwaam.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhina bẹ́, “Amma m'nninga abọ, ọma m'abạra afhọ anạng p'Midiyan phyibh aben bẹ́ afhọ ọnạng wạnọ.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gideọn n'ubhin bẹ́, “Ode amma kk'ọphyaam nkhaama k'akhọ k'ititikha, ọma m'anạng-m ẹkhọhkha ch'amma m'ntima nsonga bẹ́ k'udik-ọkka, ọma wọ n'akpaak abamẹ. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Totokhạn, ninga mama tikh-m, ttạr mkpa nnạm ẹnạnga chaam achẹ, nkwu njẹ k'akhọ k'ititikha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, “Amma m'nninga ntikh-ọ tạrr akpa nnạm.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Mạnna wọ Gideọn ofon ọta ọtạkha uvu-nwa ọfhọ, utima usi uchiattọhk, ọbạra ọtạkha abubuma k'ọgbanggbang, utima usi brẹd kw'abẹ n'nạn yist nágia. Ọtạkha uchiattọhk mvọ f'oge k'ikhạrạbaang, ọttạra nten nnọ s'ining k'isọhkha, ọtạkha ọta ober-ẹ ma k'ichirin ch'oak.<verse eid="JDG 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Itọhmọ s'Ubinọkpaabyi iben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tạkha nten nnọ ọttạra brẹd nwọ kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia nạna k'ẹtakpa nja, atạkha asi p'nten nnọ afona ma k'ẹrạng.” Ma wọ Gideọn usi oche ngwọ. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi itim ironẹmma kw'uchikwura kw'itim k'akhẹ k'ọbọhk, utwu nten nnọ ọttạra brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia. Ekpon iyin ma k'ẹtakpa ichi nten nnọ ọttạra brẹd nwọ. Ma wọ itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi idạkhẹ idimi. <verse eid="JDG 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Masẹ Gideọn n'osong bẹ́, itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi rọ, ọwạmọ oben bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng! Amma kk'itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ititikha ọttạra ititikha nsia e!”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Okhenkha, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “ Tte ẹmẹm ininga abọ! Nạng-ọ ojor, khiri mápe.”<verse eid="JDG 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Osenga ma, Gideọn usi ijabyi mạma, ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, oyeri sẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi Wọ Ode Ẹmẹm. Tạrr ukpira k'iwu ch'chemma, ijabyi nnọ ibe k'ofhon kw'Ọphra, k'ẹkhạma ch'Abiẹz.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Ma irunguwu njọ jạnẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Gideọn bẹ́, “Tạkha ẹbhaam-dim ch'ẹkhaam ẹfa ch'ettong afa k'itirakpo py'atte, ch'ede icho isenọfa. Atima anunu ijabyi nnọ s'atte n'uninga okpobha Baal, abạra akpaara mkpọmmachi s'Ashẹra s'ibe ibaanga sẹ, ajẹ. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Asi ijabyi ikkasẹ k'okpecho k'ẹrạng ọttạra nta, anạng amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwọ. Tạkha mkpọmmachi nnọ s'Ashẹra s'akpaar, ọttạra ẹbhaam-dim njọ ch'ettong mfa, asi ẹja-ẹkkạmachẹ.”<verse eid="JDG 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Mạnna wọ Gideọn ọtạk atọhmnạng pẹ ncho jobh, ofona ọta usi oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaakh-ẹ. Okhenkha, ukwuru ojora f'ọkhaam otena k'anạng p'ẹchọhmfạr chẹ, ọttạra k'ajunung p'ofon kw'Ọphra, usi ijabyi nnọ k'irungu, s'wạra ọbaan bẹ́ usi k'ẹya.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Masẹ ajunung p'ofon ngwọ aphyạbh k'ekpebha, abẹ n'akwu ase bẹ́, ijabyi s'Baal kk'ikhibha, ẹkpọmmachi ch'Ashẹra ch'ebe ẹbaanga sẹ ẹbạra ẹkpaara, abẹ atima adạkhẹ ẹbhaam-dim ch'ettong mfa afọhnọ ẹja ma ijabyi nnọ ibhasẹ.<verse eid="JDG 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Abẹ abhạkhẹ abạbh ayok bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ usi udik ngwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:29">Masẹ abẹ atạk okpe adwạn udik ngwọ, abẹ akpaak bẹ bẹ́, “Gideọn kw'ode nnwa kw'Joash ẹwọ usi kwẹ e.”<verse eid="JDG 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Ma wọ ajunung p'ofhon ngwọ afon ata aben Joash bẹ́, “Tima ujunungnwa kwọ ayin kha iyaan. Ẹma ọbaan bẹ́ ope, ukwuru bẹ́, ẹma k'ijabyi s'Baal ọvọhkha, ọbạra ọkpaara ẹkpọmmachi ch'Ashẹra ch'ebe ẹbaanga sẹ.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Okhenkha, Joash ubhin oyokhanạng-saabha nwọ kw'ubuẹ-ẹ idumsẹ, kw'ọbaabh-ẹ oge ngekha bẹ́, “Abạnga bạra arima irima anạng Baal o? Abạnga n'akhonga bẹ́ abạnga akkaan-ẹ sa? Ọnạng kwidede kw'urim irima ọnạng Baal ọbaan bẹ́ abẹ afhẹ-ẹ k'ekpebha! De Baal ọkhaam ẹfa k'udik-ọkka, tte urima irima chẹ oyeni k'okpe kw'ọnạng ọvọhkhọ ijabyi sẹ kadẹ.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Ma o, ma iwu njọ, abẹ n'ayeri Gideọn “Jerub-Baal,” aben bẹ́, “Tte Baal urima abẹ,” ukwuru s'ọvọhkhọ ijabyi s'Baal.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Ma okpe ngwọ, wa ẹkhạma ch'Midiyan, ọttạra ch'Amalẹk, ọttạra nkhạma idwạk-ọdwạk s'irukhu k'ukhubha kw'okpebha-dudon, abẹ afhunu ẹfa ajekha ọraanga kw'Jọrdan, ata abhing kha ipekhuma s'Jẹzrẹl. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Ma wọ ọkpaakpa s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi isạk, inwa Gideọn, oge ẹsa utima oyeri anạng p'Abiez bẹ́, abẹ atwạn abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Ọtọhm atek-nkkaabha k'ẹkhạma ch'Manasẹ phyibh bẹ́, abẹ atima ekpongkpo akwu, ọbạra ọtọhm okkena ẹkhạma ch'Ashẹr, ọttạra ch'Zebulun, ọttạra ch'Naphtali, ọfha abẹ ma attạra avura akhebha bẹ kha.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Gideọn o, n'obeni Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “De ọdaakh-ọ bẹ́, asenga k'akhaam k'mbọhk akkaana anạng p'Israẹl k'oche kw'kk'achekha, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />kkere e, amma m'ntạkha otenkpa kw'ivu nyaan k'ibyi s'abẹ n'akhaan agwu. Ode ipọhrọ itebhi ma k'ottenkpa nwọ mạnkkeni, asẹ k'isek nítebha, amma m'ntima mạma nsonga bẹ́, k'udik-ọkka, ọma m'asenga k'mbọhk saam akkaana anạng p'Israẹl k'oche kw'akpaakhẹ.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Oche ngwọ gwọ kw'akwẹ ode. Gideọn ọphyạbh k'ekpebha k'iwu ch'echobh; ọmyạna otenkpa nwọ, asi ayin p'afhu okpobhu-mbọhk.<verse eid="JDG 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Ma wọ Gideọn obeni Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Nạng-ọ ọdwạkhọ amma abẹ. Tte amma mbạra mphyem okpe ngwa gwạnọ. Tte-m ọbọhk ma okpe ngwa nsi adạkhẹ eyoma ọttạra otenkpa nwa. Ẹkpa nja, ọma m'asi otenkpa nwọ ugwu-ugwu, ipọhrọ ibubha k'isisek mạnkkeni, irik otenkpa. <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Ma irungu njọ, Ubinọkpaabyi usi oche ngwọ. Otenkpa mạnkkeni wọ ugwu-ugwu, ipọhrọ ibubha isisek phyibh.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s1">Gideọn okhem anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Midiyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Wa k'ekpebhawu jạnẹ, Jerub-Baal (kw'ode Gideọn) ọttạra ajunung pẹ phyibh abhingi k'efhobhcho ch'Harọd. Wa ibyibhingasẹ s'anạng p'Midiyan ining k'ibir-ibira kw'ipekhuma s'ibaang okpecho kw'More. <verse eid="JDG 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Gideọn bẹ́, “Ajunung p'akhaam asaabhẹ aseng eden. Amma anạng p'Midiyan mạ́ntạkha nge bẹ k'mbọhk. Oyongu mạma, anạng p'Israẹl m'asi-m ẹmma aben bẹ́, ‘Ẹfa chamạna kk'mạna ẹkaana e.’ <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Ma o, m'asi ẹyaakha anạng arim-mkpong bẹ́, ‘Tte ọnạng kwidede kw'n'ọfhạnọ <char style="it">bẹ́, tikhi-tikhi</char> ukwuru ojora, ubina k'okpecho kw'Gilead ọmmạnga nnạm.’ “Ma wọ ajunung nnọhna arạbh afa ukuma chi, akpa nnạm abhạna, n'urikhi ajunung nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma asen.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Okhenkha, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Gideọn bẹ́, “Ajunung mbọ atim asaabhẹ aseng eden. Tạkha bẹ sạkha kha efhobh, ọfha nnyoma bẹ nnạng-ọ. Ode mbeni bẹ, ‘Oyok nwa ẹwọ m'ọtwạn abọ,’ ẹma wọ m'ọtwạn abọ; okhenka, ode mbeni bẹ́, ‘Oyok nwa abọ mọ́twạn,’ abọ mọ́twạn.”<verse eid="JDG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Ma wọ Gideọn utim ajunung mbọ ọsạkha k'efhobh. Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Gideọn bẹ́, “K'ikhaana s'ajunung p'attim ndwudwungu agwo asi, tekha ayok p'atim ẹdaak akperi asi masẹ ẹpfa ẹttaakhẹ asi.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Wa ajunung arạbh chi ẹbọ p'atim mbọhk akperi asi agwo. Ajunung mbọkha phyibh attim ndwudwungu agwo.<verse eid="JDG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Gideọn bẹ, “Ajunung mbọ arạbh chi p'atim mbọhk akperi asi agwo, ebọ p'amma m'nsenga ma nkkaan-ọ, mbạra ntạkha anạng p'Midiyan nge bạnga k'mbọhk. Tte ajunung mbọkha phyibh ammạnga nnạm, ọnạng-ọnạng k'akhẹ k'ukkira.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Ma wọ wa Gideọn ọtọhmọ anạng mbọkha p'Israẹl phyi-phyibh akpa nnạm k'akkira pabẹ, okhenka, wa ochokhu ajunung mbọ arạbh chi, p'atọhk ogbạre ọttạra nsa s'abukpọhng p'ayok mbọkha p'afon-ofona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:8">Ma okpe ngwọ, wa ibyibhingasẹ s'anạng p'Midiyan ining k'ipekhuma k'isekhisek kw'Gideọn. <verse eid="JDG 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Ma irungu njọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Gideọn bẹ́, “Bina ata arima anạng p'Midiyan abẹ k'ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ, ukwuru bẹ́, amma m'ntạkha bẹ ọtạkha nge ọ k'mbọhk. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />De ojor-ọ ojora bẹ́, ata arima bẹ abẹ, sạkha k'ibyibhingasẹ, ọtọhmnạng kwọ Pura abẹ, <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />khọhmọ itọhng abhaanga idik s'abẹ n'akpaak. Ma wọ m'abạr ettem, ata arima anạng mbọ abẹ k'ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ.” Ma wọ, ẹma ọttạra ọtọhmnạng kwẹ Pura, asạk afona kha iyaan k'ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />N'ode s'anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Midiyan, ọttạra anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Amalẹk, ọttạra anạng p'nkhạma s'irukhu k'ukhubha kw'okpebha-dudon kk'atobha masẹ ọsaabh f'agwurubhebhe k'ipekhuma. Akamẹl pabẹ abạra asaabh masẹ opong kw'ọraanga kw'ọnạng n'mókke ubhik.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Ma wọ Gideọn ọjạrọ-ọjạrọ ọta ukpira k'ọkpe kw'ujunung wạnọ n'ọkpaak oyok idachen s'ọttaar bẹ́, “Amma nttaar idachen s'nse brẹd kw'ode iriring kw'abẹ atim barli asi, kw'n'otto-otto ugina tạrr, ọta ọnwa k'ibyibhingasẹ s'anạng p'Midiyan. Utima ẹfa njọ ọta ọtọhbh k'ukkira, akwẹ ọbhạkhẹ mkper otto ukhubha.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Osenga ma, oyok-udikkobh kwẹ ubhina bẹ́, “Udik ọdwạkh-ọdwạk kòde, kw'oyongu bẹ́, ọkkangkkang-kkro kw'Gideọn kw'ode nnwa kw'Joash, kw'ubin Israẹl wọ. Ubinọkpaabyi kk'anạng p'Midiyan, ọttạra ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ phyibh ọtạkha ugi ẹ k'mbọhk.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />K'okpe kw'Gideọn ọbhaang idachen nnọ, ọttạra oche kw'asẹ iyini, utwunga echo ọnạng Ubinọkpaabyi ikpukpobha. Ọkpa nnạm ọbhạna k'ibyibhingasẹ s'anạng p'Israẹl, oben bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga abina e, khiri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'anạng p'Midiyan, ọttạra ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ ọtạkha oge bạnga k'mbọhk e!” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Ukwu ọbhaangẹ ajunung arạbh chi mbọ k'ibyi ittaan, ọtạkha abukpọhng ọttạra agbạre p'ọttọhk nạn ode oge bẹ phyibh k'mbọhk, ọttạra akhebh p'ọnna oge ma k'agbạre mbọ ẹtaanga.<verse eid="JDG 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Oben bẹ bẹ́, “Akker-m o, abạnga ator-m k'ntwạkhọ. De mkpir k'ibyibhingasẹ ọkhaan-ọkhaan, oche kwidede kw'nsi, abạnga asi oche ngwọ. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />K'okpe kw'amma ọttạra anạng phyibh p'aning abamẹ ange abukpọhng pamạna, oche ngwọ gwọ kw'abạnga ma phyibh p'aning abaabha mạna ma ibyibhingasẹ, m'age abukpọhng pabạnga, abạra awur ẹmạng aben bẹ́, ‘Ekhema ede ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọttạra ch'Gideọn.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Mạnna wọ kw'Gideọn ọttạra ajunung arạbh asen p'aning abẹ ata akpira k'ibyibhingasẹ s'anạng mbọ ọkhaan-ọkhaan, bạrạsẹ n'ukpir k'irungutem, k'okpe kw'abe kk'atik-ibyi afona. Abẹ age abukpọhng pabẹ, abạra avọhkhọ ogbạre f'abẹ atim k'mbọhk. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Ikhaana nnọ ittaan ige abukpọhng, ibạra ivọhkhọ agbạre. Ọnạng-ọnạng utim ikhebh k'ọkwabọhk, ọttạra abukpọhng k'udimbọhk, ọnạng-ọnạng uwuru ẹmạng oben bẹ́, “Abạnga atima akkangkkang-kkro arima irima nja anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọttạra Gideọn!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Ujunung kwidede obe k'akhẹ k'ibyi, abẹ abaabha ibyibhingasẹ nnọ, anạng p'Midiyan phyibh n'arạbh, agạma.<verse eid="JDG 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Masẹ abukpọhng mbọ arạbh chi age, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi ajunung p'Midiyan phyi-phyibh abhạkhẹ atima akkangkkang-kkro pabẹ oyeni n'arima abẹma oyeni abẹ. Arim-ekpong mbọ arạbhọ atena kha Bet-Shita, kha ukhubha kw'Zerera tạrr, akpira kha erem ch'Abẹl-Mẹhola, ọbaanga Tabat. <verse eid="JDG 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Anạng p'Israẹl p'abin k'ẹkhạma ch'Naptali, ọttạra ch'Ashẹr, ọttạra ẹkhạma ch'Manasẹ phyi-phyibh ayini k'iyaan akhubh anạng p'Midiyan. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Wa Gideọn ọtọhmọ akpaakh-nkkaabha ọbaabha efhondiden ch'okpecho kw'Ephraim, oben bẹ́, “Abạnga asạkha akwu arima anạng p'Midiyan abẹ, abạnga abạra akpa bẹ eden ma k'Ọraanga kw'Jọrdan tạrr akpira kha Bet-Bara.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:24">Ma wọ ajunung p'ẹkhạma ch'Ephraim phyi-phyibh afon ata akpa bẹ eden mạma k'Oraanga kw'Jọrdan tạrr akpira kha Bet-Bara. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Wa abẹ abạra avạkha adecho afa p'anạng p'Midiyan p'ade: Oreb ọttạra Zeeb. Abẹ afhọ Oreb k'ẹtakpa ch'Oreb, abẹ afhọ Zeeb k'ibyi s'abẹ n'amyạna achidwuk kha Zeeb. Wa abẹ akhubhu anạng p'Midiyan, abạra atima echo ch'Oreb, ọttạra ch'Zeeb akkena Gideọn, kw'uning kha Jọrdan ọkhaan-ọkhaan.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s1">Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Wa anạng p'Ephraim abạbhọ Gideọn bẹ́, “Asi yạn asi mạna oche ngwa? Ode yạn kw'nạn mạna náyera antwạn abọ anta annima anạng p'Midiyan abẹ?” Akwẹ ọdwạkhọ bẹ k'idaam oyeni, otena abẹ.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Okhenkha ubhina bẹ bẹ́, “Mbạng vọ f'amma kk'nsia f'obeng k'mvọ f'abạnga kk'asia? Ubibini kw'abạnga adibhi k'iwonu s'agrep p'Ephraim, nújibha ọyọhnga iphya kubungu s'abạnga asi k'owonu kw'agrep p'Abiezer o? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Oreb, ọttạra Zeeb p'ade adecho p'anạng p'Midiyan ọvạkha oge bạnga k'mbọhk. Mbạng vọ f'amma nsia mama f'ọbạrẹ ọyọhnga f'ọma asi o?” Ukwuru ibhina ch'ọnạngẹ bẹ́, idwạdwạkhọ s'abẹ akhaam abẹ o, isạkha.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Chibhi s'Gideọn ọttạra ajunung pẹ arạbh chi ọkhọhnọ bẹ, abẹ afon ororo akhubh anạng p'Midiyan tạrr, akpira Jọrdan, abạra ajekha ọraanga ukhubha. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Wa obeni ajunung p'Sukọt bẹ́, “Abạnga anạng arim-ekpong paam brẹd; khiri okwo kk'bẹ ọkhaama, amma m'nfona ororo nkhubh Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna, p'ade avaar p'Midiyan.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Okhenkha, ikhaana s'Sukot ibeni bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'm'annạng arim-ekpong pọ brẹd, s'nạn Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna tạm návạkha?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Osenga ma, Gideọn ubhina bẹ́, “Mase n'ode oche ngwọ, k'okpe kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'aam Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna ugia k'mbọhk, amma m'ntima nsidima ọttạra akkaangẹ p'ameni k'ibyi s'anạng n'nárua, nnyaakhẹ bạnga atennạng k'ayaara-k'ayaara.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Ubina ma ofona kha Pẹniyẹl, ọta ophyem bẹ udik ngwọ gwạnọ. Okhenkha, ajunung p'ofhon kw'Pẹniyẹl abạra anạng-ẹ ibhina njọ jạnẹ ch'ajunung p'Sukot anạng-ẹ. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Osenga ma, oben ajunung p'Pẹniyẹl bẹ́, “ De nkwun ekhema achẹ, m'nkhibhi itọhrọ nna s'atikh-ofhon n'aninga atik ofhon.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Wa Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna aning kha Karkọr ọttạra arim-ekpong p'akpir ajunung nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma chikhamfa ukuma arạbh jobh. Wa arim-ekpong phyi-phyibh p'arikhi k'nkhạma s'okpebha-dudon ẹbọ mạma; s'arim-ekpong nnọhna arạbh chi p'atim akkangkkang-kkro kk'apua. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Wa Gideọn osengi k'ọkkaden kw'akker-itirakpo p'arukhu k'ukhubha kw'okpebha-dudon kha Noba, ọttạra Jogbeha, ọta urima arim-ekpong mbọ abẹ, k'okpe kw'abẹ nạn ichen náchokha. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Ma wọ Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna p'ade avaar afa p'Midiyan arạbhọ. Okhenkha, Gideọn ukhubhu bẹ ma tạrr, ọvạkha bẹ, ọbạra oge arim-ekpong p'anạng mbọ phyibh k'ojora.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Wa Gideọn kw'ode nnwa kw'Joash ubin k'ekpong, ukwu k'ọkkaden kw'Heres ukwuna. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Ọvạkha udikkobh wạnọ kw'ubin Sukọt, ọdwạn-ẹ, udikkobh nwọ o, n'ọkkẹrẹ ache p'ikhaana s'Sukọt anạng-nạbh attaan ukuma chikhamfa, p'ade adennạng p'ofhon ngwọ, ọnạng-ẹ. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Ma wọ Gideọn ofon ọta okhebha ajunung p'Sukọt oben bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga akkeri Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna mama, p'abạnga aseng abẹ anukh-m, aben bẹ́, ‘Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna khẹ mbạn o? M'ansi yạn annạng ajunung pọ p'kk'bẹ ọkhọhna brẹd?’ ” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Utim adennạng p'ofhon ngwọ okpebhi ajunung p'Sukọt esonga, s'utim nsidima ọttạra akkaangẹ p'ameni k'ibyi s'anạng nạn árukha ọnạng bẹ irem. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Wa ọbạra ọvọhkhọ ittọhrọ s'atikh-ofhon n'aninga atik ofhon kw'Pẹniyẹl, ọbạra ọfhọ ajunung p'ofhon ngwọ.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Ma wọ ọbạbhọ Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna bẹ́, “Bạng ajunung demapẹ bọ p'abạnga afhọ k'Tabọr?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Ajunung mbọ abhina bẹ́, “Ajunung masẹ akhọ e, kwidede ọkhaam efhora ch'ọvaar-nwa.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gideọn ubhina bẹ́, “Ajunung mbọ ade ivọkka paam e, abẹ ade ajunungva p'ọkka kwaam. K'oche ngwa kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, de wạra abạnga atte bẹ ọbọhk abẹ aruk akpen, amma wạra bạnga mámfhọ.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Ọbhạkhẹ okkeri Jeter, kw'ode ocheden-nwa kwẹ, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Fhọ bẹ́!” Okhenkha, Jeter ọkkangkkang-kkro kwẹ nọ́twạra, s'utim ode udikkobh-nwa, ọbạra ojor-ẹ ojora.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Ma wọ Zeba ọttạra Zalmuna n'aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma oyeni, senga k'akhọ k'ifor si udik ngwa. Ujunung abẹ n'asong-ẹ k'oche kw'ẹfa chẹ ede e.” Oche ngwọ wọ kw'Gideọn oseng ofora bẹ k'ititikha, ọfhọ bẹ, ọtạkha enya-kpo py'abẹ atim afhạrọ akamẹl pabẹ k'ẹdwạngọ.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ẹphọd kw'Gideọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl abeni Gideọn bẹ́, “Dạbh mạna; ọma ọttạra ujunungnwa kwọ, ọttạra nnwa mfona kwọ kw'ujunung, ukwuru bẹ́, ọma kk'mạna akkaana arạbha mạna k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Midiyan.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Okhenkha, Gideọn ubhin bẹ bẹ́, “Amma bạnga mạ́ndạbh, nnwa kwaam bạnga mọ́bạra ọdạbh. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ m'ọdạbh bạnga.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Ọbạra oben bẹ bẹ́, “Amma nkhaam ephyema jạnẹ, nnoru bẹ́, ọnạng-ọnạng, ọnạng-m ọkkra kwẹ kw'itọhng k'okhebh pfẹ f'uchi k'ekpong.” (Wa ode ẹmmaana ch'anạng p'Ishmayẹl bẹ́, abẹ n'age akkra p'gol k'itọhng.)<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Abẹ abhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Ettem erebhi mạna bẹ́, annạng-ọ pyẹ.” Ma wọ abẹ atạk ẹnọhmakpa ammaama ajẹ, ọnạng-ọnạng ọrạbha ọkkra kwẹ kw'ufum k'ekpong ọbhạrẹ ma. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Wa adọhbh py'ekpo mbyọ py'gol py'ọbạbhọ bẹ, ikpir adọhbh py'ashẹkẹl nnọhna nnebung ukuma arạbh asen. Wa abẹ arạbh ubhik f'adọhbh p'ẹnya-kpo, ọttạra adọhbh py'ekpo py'ọmaan f'ẹdwạngọ, ọttạra ch'nwuru s'avaarnạng p'Midiyan n'age, akwu attạra k'adọhbh p'mgbakkọhbhọ p'abẹ n'akpạna akamẹl pabẹ k'ẹdwạngọ. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Wa Gideọn utim gol usi ẹphọd, kw'ọtạk ochok k'Ọphra, kw'ode ofhon kwẹ. Wa anạng p'Israẹl phyibh akpa-nnạm avạra Ubinọkpaabyi, n'asi isaasa-dik atima akpobha ẹphọd nwọ, udik ngwọ n'ode ọkpaak-k'ẹdwạngọ ọnạng Gideọn ọttạra ẹchọhmfạr chẹ.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obo kw'Gideọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Ma wọ wa anạng p'Midiyan aning k'isekhisek kw'anạng p'Israẹl, abẹ efa jạnẹ-jạnẹ dạk nákhaama. Anạng p'Israẹl arukhu k'ẹmẹm k'icho arạbh afa, k'okpe kw'Gideọn urukhu akpen phyibh.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Wa Jerub-Baal kw'ode nnwa kw'Joash ọkpa nnạm ọtta uruk k'akhẹ k'ofhon. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Ẹma oyeni wa, ofhonu ajunungva arạbh attaan ukuma jobh, ukwuru bẹ́ ọkhaam ipanạng k'ọsaabh. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Oyok kwẹ kw'ikwaanạng kw'urukhu k'Shẹkẹm ọbạra ọmmaan-ẹ nnwa kw'ujunung, kw'okpen Abimẹlẹk. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Wa Gideọn kw'ode nnwa kw'Joash ope s'kkọhtạmma, abẹ anọhng-ẹ k'epewur ch'otte Joash k'Ọphra k'ofhon kw'Abiez.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Masẹ Gideọn ku'pua, anạng p'Israẹl abạra atta asi asaasa kpen akpobha ikha s'Baal. Abẹ atta asi ọkha f'okpen Baal-Bẹrit akpobha, <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />anạng p'Israẹl akpa nnạm avạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabẹ kw'kk'bẹ ọkkaana k'mbọhk s'awawunanạng pabẹ phyibh p'abaabha bẹ. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Ma wọ, wa abẹ ijibha n'asia anạng ẹchọmfạr ch'Jeru-Baal (kw'okpen Gideọn) k'idik jibha s'kkusia ọnạng anạng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ẹkka-pyibha ch'Abimẹlẹk.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Wa Abimẹlẹk kw'ode nnwa kw'Jerub-Baal ofon ọtta okhebha ivọkka p'ọkka kha Shẹkẹm, ọttạra uchi f'ọkka phyi-phyibh, oben bẹ bẹ́, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Bạbh ammaana p'Shẹkẹm phyibh bẹ́, ‘Ngwạn gwọ m'ujibh bạnga: bẹ́ iva arạbh attaan ukuma jobh phyibh p'Jerub-Baal adạbh bạnga saa, bẹ́ oyok wạnọ mạnkkeni ọdạbh bạnga?” Abạnga ajima bẹ́ amma nde kwabạnga o.”<verse eid="JDG 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Masẹ ivọkka atạk idik nnọ phyibh akpaak anạng p'Shẹkẹm, anạng mbọ achera bẹ́, abẹ m'atwạn Abimẹlẹk abẹ, aben bẹ́, “Ẹma wọ ode nwọkka kwamạna e.” <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Abẹ atạkha ashẹkẹl p'asilva arạbh attaan ukuma jobh k'ọchọhm kw'Baal-Bẹrit anạng-ẹ, Abimẹlẹk utima pyẹ obher aseng nden-nden bạnọ bẹ́, abẹ ade ayok-ikhaana pẹ. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Ubina ofona k'ọchọhm kw'otte k'Ọphra, ọta obe k'ẹtakpa jạnẹ ọfhọ ivotte pẹ anạng-nạbh attaan ukuma jobh, pade iva p'Jerub-Baal. Okhenkha, Jotam kw'ode okponga-nnạm kw'Jerub-Baal, ọrạbh ọta uttubha. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Ma wọ anạng p'Shẹkẹm phyibh, ọttạra anạng p'Bet-Milo ata atobha abaanga k'ichi chididen ch'oak, ọfha abẹ anạng Abimẹlẹk ẹvaar.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Masẹ abẹ akpaakhẹ Jotam udik ngwa, uvura k'okpecho kw'Gerizim k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng, ọkwọhr bẹ ẹmạng oben bẹ́, “Abạnga akhọhm-m itọhng, abạnga ma anạng p'Shẹkẹm, ọfha Ubinọkpaabyi ọkhọhmọ bạnga itọhng <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Iwu mạnna jạnẹ, wa nchi ita bẹ́ ita irengi ọvaarnạng kwabẹ. Asẹ ifhon ita iben ichi ch'oliv bẹ́, ‘De ọvaarnạng kwamạna.’<verse eid="JDG 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />“Okhenkha, ichi ch'oliv ipọhn bẹ́, ‘Ma, s'amma n'nkum ana paam yi-yin p'abẹ n'atima anạng ikha ọttạra ayokhanạng ikpukpobha, nta ndạbh ẹvaar ch'nchi?’<verse eid="JDG 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />“Oyongu ma, nchi nnọ n'ibeni ichi ch'fig bẹ́, ‘Kwu ade mạna ọvaarnạng.’<verse eid="JDG 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />“Okhenkha, ichi ch'fig ipọhn bẹ́, ‘Ma, s'amma n'nkum achi-dwuk paam yạ-yạm, p'ajibh-ujibh, abạra arebh, nkwu ndạbh ẹvaar ch'nchi?’<verse eid="JDG 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />“Ma wọ nchi nnọ ibeni ichi ch'grep bẹ́, ‘Kwu ade mạna ọvaarnạng.’<verse eid="JDG 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />“Okhenkha, ichi ch'grep ipọhn bẹ́, ‘Ma, n'tte ọbọhk k'atwuk-rebhada paam, p'n'anạng ayokhanạng ọttạra ikha ottennebh yiyin, nta ndạbh ẹvaar ch'nchi?’<verse eid="JDG 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />“K'ekponga-nnạm, nchi nnọ phyibh n'ibeni ọkkaangẹ bé, ‘Kwu ade mạna ọvaarnạng.’<verse eid="JDG 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />“Ọkkaangẹ oben nchi bẹ́, ‘De ode bẹ́ k'udik-ọkka, abạnga m'abyenga amma ana k'echo nde ọvaarnạng kwabạnga, abạnga akwu akwokha ọyọng k'akhaam k'ofho. Okhenkha, ode nạn oche ngwọ núdia, tte ekpon iyin k'ọkkaangẹ, ẹkkạmọ cedars kw'Lebanọn!’<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />“Abạnga kk'abạrada atạkha, abạra asi udik kw'ujibh-ujibh bẹ́ abạnga anạng Abimẹlẹk ẹvaar?Abạnga kk'oche kw'ọbaan asia, anạng Jerub-Baal ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ? Abạnga kk'asia anạng-ẹ k'oche kw'ọbaan bẹ́ abạnga asi o? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Abạnga ajima bẹ́, wa otte kwaam urim nnima k'abạnga k'echo, oge akpen pẹ k'dạma-dạma, ọfha ọrạbha bạnga k'irem s'anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Midiyan. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Okhenkha, k'iwu ch'chemma, abạnga kk'abhạkha arima ẹchọhmfhạr ch'otte kwaam abẹ. Abạnga kk'ajunungva pẹ, anạng-nạbh attaan ukuma jobh afha k'ẹtakpa jạnẹ. Abạnga atạkha Abimẹlẹk, kw'ode nnwa kw'ubira-kwanạng kwẹ, asi ọvaarnạng kw'anạng p'Shẹkẹm, ukwuru s'ode nwọkka kwabạnga. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Ma, abạnga kk'abạrada atạkha, abạra asi udik kw'ujibh-ujibh anạng Jerub-Baal ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ chemma o? De ode mạnna, tte Abimẹlẹk ode otennebh kw'abạnga, tte abạnga ma abạra ade otennebh kwẹ! ” <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Okhenkha, de abạnga nạn oche ngwọ násia, tte ekpon ch'ibin k'Abimẹlẹk ichi abạnga ma anạng p'Shẹkẹm, ọttạra anạng p'Bet-Milo. Tte ekpon ibina k'abạnga ma anạng p'Shẹkẹm ọttạra Bet-Milo, ichi Abimẹlẹk!”<verse eid="JDG 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Ma wọ Jotam ọrạbhọ ofona k'ofhon kw'Beer ọta uruk kha, ukwuru ojora f'nwotte Abimẹlẹk.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Masẹ Abimẹlẹk kk'Israẹl ọdạbha k'icho ittaan, <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Ubinọkpaabyi otte akpakpa-pyibha ọbọhk, anwa Abimẹlẹk ọttạra ammaana p'Shẹkẹm, kw'usi bẹ abẹ akpọhkhọ Abimẹlẹk abẹ echo. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Wa Ubinọkpaabyi usi akwẹ ode oche ngwọ, ọfha utima ottera udik kw'Abimẹlẹk ọttạra ammaana p'Shẹkẹm asi, p'ator-ẹ afhọ ajunungva arạbh attaan ukuma jobh p'Jerub-Baal, abạra abyenga isẹ sabẹ. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Wa anạng p'Shẹkẹm abhạkh-ẹ abẹ, abẹ atọhm ajunung p'afon ata attubha k'akkaden p'akpecho, n'avạkha anạng p'n'asenga ma ekpo ana. Wa abẹ atạk udik ngwa akpaak Abimẹlẹk.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Ma o, Gaal kw'ode nnwa kw'Ebed utim ẹnạmma chẹ ubina otena kha Shẹkẹm. Wa ammaana p'ẹnạmma njọ akhaam ochen-chokha k'Gaal. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Masẹ abẹ kk'abina ayin k'iwonu ata aphya agrep atima asi atwuk o, abẹ n'akpong ma, asi erobha k'ọkha-pa k'ọkha fabẹ. Abẹ achi, abạra agwo, n'asaakhẹ Abimẹlẹk. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Osenga ma, Gaal kw'ode nnwa kw'Ebed, oben bẹ́, “Abimẹlẹk oyeni ode bạng ọnạng che o, kw'amạna mba anạng p'Shẹkẹm m'anninga k'isek-isek kwẹ o? Ẹma sạng ode nnwa kw'Jerub-Baal, kw'Zebul onyem-ẹ k'edenạng? Mbẹ, n'oseng yạn kw'n'anning k'isekh-isek kw'Abimẹlẹk o? M'antera ansạkha echo annạng attitte Hamọr, kw'ode otte kw'Shẹkẹm. <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Wạra anạng mba n'aning k'isekh-isek kwaam o! Wạra m'ndim-ẹ. Wạra m'mben Abimẹlẹk bẹ́, ‘Tima akpong-nạng pọ phyibh yin kha iyaan!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Masẹ Zebul kw'ọdạbhẹ ẹkhạma ch'efhondiden, ọbhaang udik kw'Gaal kw'ode nnwa kw'Ebed ọkpaakhẹ, ettem ẹkhạm-ẹ ipyibha-ipyibha. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Osenga idubh-idubha ọtọhm akpaakh-nkkaabha okkena Abimẹlẹk oben bẹ́, “Gaal kw'ode nnwa kw'Ebed, ọttạra ivọkka pẹ kk'akwua kha Shẹkẹm, akwu achọhma anạng p'efhondiden asi abọ ẹkhọhr e. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Ma wọ, m'abina ajunung pọ abẹ ma irungu, abạnga akwu ayima k'iwonu, atik bẹ. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />K'ekpebha s'ududon m'uyin, abạnga abina ata arima efhondiden njọ abẹ. K'okpe kw'Gaal ọttạra ajunung pẹ ayini bẹ́, akwu arima bạnga abẹ o, abạnga bạra atima eden njọ, arima bẹ abẹ. ”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Ma wọ Abimẹlẹk ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ phyi-phyibh abin osenga ma irungu, abẹ abhaangẹ abẹma oyeni k'ikhaana innebung, ata attubha k'ibyi-k'ibyi abaanga Shẹkẹm. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Mạnna wọ Gaal, kw'ode nnwa kw'Ebed ofon ọta obe k'ẹbaakhamma ch'efhondiden utik, otor k'okpe kw'Abimẹlẹk, ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ m'abina kha ibyi sabẹ attubh ayin k'iyaan.<verse eid="JDG 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Masẹ Gaal ose bẹ, oben Zebul bẹ́, “Kkeri oche kw'anạng n'abina kha okpecho asạkha e!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Zebul ubhina bẹ́, “Akpakpa p'akpecho, ẹbọ n'ase mạma e, akkẹ bẹ́ ayokhanạng bọ sa?”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Okhenkha, Gaal ọbạra oben bẹ́, “Kkeri oche kw'anạng n'abina kha okpecho asạkha e, ikhaana rạnẹ ikwuma kha ọkkaden kw'ichi ch'abọnganạng e.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Ma wọ, Zebul oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kkeri ẹmma mạma, ọma sạng kw'iwu njọ abeni bẹ́, ‘Abimẹlẹk oyeni ode bạng ọnạng chẹ, kw'amạna mba m'anninga k'isekh-isek kwẹ?’ Ajunung mba sạng p'iwu njọkha n'anukhu o? Yin kha iyaan ata arima bẹ abẹ ẹ!”<verse eid="JDG 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Ma wọ kw'Gaal utim ammaana p'Shẹkẹm eden, ọta urima Abimẹlẹk abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Abimẹlẹk ukhubh-ẹ tạrr, ukpira k'ẹbaakhamma ch'efhondiden, abẹ afhọ anạng sabhaada ma eden, s'abẹ n'arạbh. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Wa Abimẹlẹk ọta uninga k'ofhon kw'Aruma. Zebul o, n'ukhubhu Gaal ọttạra ẹnạmma chẹ abina k'Shẹkẹm.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Iwu echobh ma, anạng p'Shẹkẹm abina ayin k'iwonu sabẹ, abẹ atạkha udik ngwọ akpaak Abimẹlẹk. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Ma wọ ọtạk ajunung pẹ obhaangẹ ikhaana ittaan, abẹ afona ata attubha k'iwonu atik. Masẹ ose s'anạng mbọ n'abina k'efhondiden ayin k'iyaan, ubina ọta urima bẹ abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Ma wọ kw'Abimẹlẹk ọttạra ikhaana sẹ enemi eden arạbh ata abe k'ororo kw'ẹbaakhamma ch'maseng anwa k'efhondiden. Ikhaana ifa ibin ita irima ayok p'aning kha iwonu, afhọ bẹ. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Ma iwu njọ kubungu, Abimẹlẹk urim efhondiden njọ abẹ tạrr, okhema chẹ, ọbạra ọfhọ anạng p'ofhon ngwọ. Ma wọ udimi efhondiden njọ, ọbạra ọtạkha unung ọnyaanẹ ọbaabha kwẹ.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Masẹ ammaana p'n'akkeri ibyi s'Shẹkẹm abhaang udik ngwa, abẹ arạbh ata attubha k'ọchọhm kw'ẸI-Bẹrit. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />K'okpe kw'Abimẹlẹk ọbhaang bẹ́ abẹ kk'atobha kha, <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />ẹma ọttạra ajunung pẹ phyibh avura afona k'okpecho kw'Zalmọn. Abimẹlẹk ọtạkha ẹbạr ọkpaara achi-bọhkha bạnọ, ọtạkha ọnạna k'nkkang. Ọnạng ajunung p'aning abẹ ẹfa bẹ́, “K'ẹbhạr-k'ẹbhạr! Abạnga asi oche kw'abạnga ase-m s'n'nsi ma!” <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Mạnna wọ kw'ajunung mbọ phyibh abạra akpaara achi-bọhkha, atima ator Abimẹlẹk nnạm. Abẹ atạkha pyẹ atobha k'ibyittubhasẹ, abẹ atạkha ekpon age akpora anạng p'aning k'ibyittubhasẹ nnọ ẹttaanga. Ma wọ anạng phyi-phyibh p'aning k'ibyittubhasẹ s'Shẹkẹm, ajunung ọttạra ipanạng p'akpir nnọhna mfa ukuma jobh, abạra ape.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Abimẹlẹk ubina mạma ọta ọbaabha ofhon kw'Tẹbẹz oge ngekha, okhema kwẹ. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Ma ẹfhondiden ẹttaanga, ọkhaam ittọhrọ s'ikpọhkhọ-ọkpọhkhọ s'ajunung ọttạra ipanạng ọttạra anạng p'efhondiden phyi-phyibh kk'arạbha ata attubha. Abẹ akpạkha akpora abẹma oyeni k'ẹttaanga, avura ata abe k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng kw'ittọhrọ nnọ. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimẹlẹk ofona k'ittọhrọ bẹ́, ọta urima anạng mbọ abẹ. Okhenkha, masẹ ukpir k'ẹbaakhamma ch'ibyi nnọ bẹ́, oge sẹ ẹkpon, <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />ma wọ ikwanạng otte ẹtakpa jạnẹ ọbọhk, achẹ ẹvọhkhọ Abimẹlẹk echo.<verse eid="JDG 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Ma wọ Abimẹlẹk oyeri utim-ekpongkpo kwẹ k'ẹbhạr-k'ẹbhạr oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Twạr ọkkangkkang-kkro kwọ fhọ-m, ọfha nạngẹ ache asi bẹ́, ‘Ikwanạng wọ ọfhẹ-ẹ e’ ” Oche ngwọ gwọ kw'ọtọhmnạng kwẹ ọtwạrọ ọkkangkkang-kkro ukhum-ẹ, ope. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Masẹ anạng p'Israẹl ase bẹ́ Abimẹlẹk kk'upua, abẹ akpa nnạm abhạna.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Oche ngwọ gwọ kw'Ubinọkpaabyi oseng utwukha igbaan s'Abimẹlẹk kk'otte kwẹ usia, s'ọfhọ iv'otte pẹ anạng-nạbh attaan ukuma jobh. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Wa Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạra usi ajunung p'Shẹkẹm ape k'ọgbaan phyibh f'abẹ asi. Wa ẹmma ch'Jotam kw'ode nnwa kw'Jerub-Baal ọraakhẹ bẹ, ẹjọ ch'ẹvạkha bẹ.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s1">Tola kw'ode ọkpaar-aponga kw'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />K'okpe kw'Abimẹlẹk kk'upua, ujunung kw'okpen Tola kw'ubin k'ẹkhạma ch'Isaaka, ọbạra ode nnwa kw'Pua kw'ode nnwa kw'Dodo, ubin bẹ́ ọkkaana anạng p'Israẹl. Wa Tola urukhu kha Shamir, k'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Ephraim. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Wa ẹma ode ọkpaar-aponga k'Israẹl icho ẹrạbh ukuma ittaan, bạrasẹ n'ope, abẹ anọhng-ẹ kha Shamir.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jair kw'ode ọkpaar-aponga kw'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Wa ọnạng kw'onyem-ẹ ode Jair kw'ubin k'ẹkhạma ch'Gilead, kw'uwa ode ọkpaar-aponga k'Israẹl k'icho ẹrạbh ukuma ifa. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Ẹma wa ofhonu ajunungva ẹrạbh ukuma jobh, p'ayaarẹ nnyạnyaang ẹrạbh ukuma jobh. Wa abẹ adạbhẹ ifhon ẹrạbh ukuma jobh kha Gilead, tạrr ukpira chemma abẹ n'ayeri sẹ Havot-Jair. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Masẹ Jair ope, abẹ anohng-ẹ kha Kamọn.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jẹphta kw'ode ọkpaar-aponga kw'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl abạra asi ibyibyia-dik k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Abẹ akpobha ikha s'Baal ọttạra s'Ashtọrẹt, ọttạra s'Aram, ọttạra s'Sidọn, ọttạra s'Moab, ọttạra s'Ammọn, ọttạra s'aPhilistiya. Wa anạng p'Israẹl akpa nnạm avạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, abẹ dạk kẹ nákpobha. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọdwạkh-ẹ anạng p'Israẹl abẹ. Ọtạkha bẹ oge k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Philistiya, ọttạra s'Ammọn, <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />p'apfuru bẹ, abạra afhọ bẹ. Wa oge anạng p'Israẹl phyibh k'irem, k'ukhubha kw'okpebha-dudon k'Jọrdan, kha Gilead, kw'ode ẹkhạma ch'anạng p'Amọr k'icho chikhanttaan. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Ammọn abạra ajekha ọraanga kw'Jọrdan ata arima ẹkhạma ch'Juda, ọttạra ch'Bẹnjamin, ọttạra ch'Ephraim abẹ; wa Israẹl uning k'irem sididen. <verse eid="JDG 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl agạm ayeri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, aben bẹ́, “Amạna mba kk'ipyibha ansia k'ititikha sọ, amạna kk'nnạm amkpa amvạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna, n'amkpobha ikha s'Baal.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọpọhnọ bẹ bẹ́, “K'okpe kw'uwa anạng p'Ijip ọttạra p'Amọr, ọttạra p'Ammọn, ọttạra p'Philistiya, <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />ọttạra p'Sidọn ọttạra p'Amalẹk, ọttạra anạng p'Maọn achokhu bạnga k'irem, abạnga agạma ẹkkaana ayer-m, wa amma bạnga nạ́nkkaana nnạbha bạnga k'mbọhk sabẹ? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Okhenkha, abạnga kk'nnạm akpa avạr-m, n'akpọbha ekpo ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk. Ẹgwọ usi, nạn adạkhẹ bạnga mạ́nkkaana. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Asọhng ata agạma ẹkkaana ayeri ikha s'abạnga kk'atekha bẹ́, abạnga akpobha. Tte asẹ ikkaana bạnga k'okpe kw'ọmmaphyaangẹ!”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Okhenkha, anạng p'Israẹl abeni Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Amạna kk'ipyibha ansia. Ọma si mạna fidede f'ọdaakh-ọ, totokhạn, khenka kkaana mạna e.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Ma wọ abẹ avọhkhọ ikha s'ining bẹ abẹ, akpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Osenga ma, Ubinọkpaabyi ọkkaana anạng p'Israẹl k'irem sabẹ.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />K'okpe kw'anạng p'Ammọn ado ifor s'ekpong ata abhing kha Gilead, anạng p'Israẹl atobh ayok ibyi rạnẹ, abhing kha Mizpa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Adecho p'anạng p'Gilead abhạkhẹ aben ayok bẹ́, “Ọnạng kwidede kw'm'uchi eden uyin k'iyaan urima anạng p'Ammọn abẹ, ẹma wọ m'ode ocho kw'anạng p'arukhu k'Gilead phyibh.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Wa Jẹphta kw'ubin Gilead ode okkemkpa kwididen kw'ekpong. Wa otte okpen Gilead; ọkka kwẹ ode ọsaasa. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Wa ikwanạng kw'Gilead ọgba ọmaan-ẹ ajunungva. Masẹ iva mbọ abạrẹ, abẹ akhubhu Jẹphta abhạrẹ k'iyaan aben bẹ́, “Ọma okhebh vạnọ-vạnọ k'ẹchọhmfhạr chamạna kákhaam, ukwuru bẹ́, ọma ade nnwa kw'ikwanạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Ma wọ Jẹphta ọrạbhọ ubina urik ivotte pẹ, ọta uruk k'isisek s'Tob, s'uwa anạng-gbaarẹ bạnọ atwạnọ abẹ, abạra aninga abẹ.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />K'okpe kw'uwa, anạng p'Ammọn arim ekpong anạng p'Israẹl abẹ, <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />adecho p'Gilead abin ata atạkha Jẹphta kha ẹkhạma ch'Tob. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Wa abẹ ayeri Jẹphta aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kwu ide mạna utim-eden kw'ekpong, ọfha annima anạng p'Ammọn abẹ.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Jẹphta ọpọhna bẹ bẹ́, “Wa abạnga khaam náwuna tạrr, abạnga akhubh-m k'ẹchọhmfhạr ch'otte kwaam o? Ode yạn kw'abạnga n'arạbhọ akwu aror-m s'abạnga n'aning k'ọmmaphyaangẹ?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Adecho p'Gilead abeni Jẹphta bẹ́, “Oseng s'ode mạna, amạna kk'ankwua ankhebh-ọ mantọhmma; kwu atwạn mạna abẹ amfona, anta annima anạng p'Ammọn abẹ, khiri ọma wọ m'ade ocho kwamạna phyibh p'annukhu k'Gilead.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Jẹphta ubhina anạng p'Gilead bẹ́, “Ode abạnga atim-m mkpa nnạm nta nnima anạng p'Ammọn abẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utim-m nkhema bẹ, s'amma m'nde bạnga ocho k'udik-ọkka o?”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Wa achonạng mbọ p'Gilead abhin Jẹphta bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ ode mạna nttẹnsẹ; amạna m'ansi-usi k'oche kw'abeni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Ma wọ Jẹphta ọtwạnọ adennạng p'Gilead abẹ, abẹ asi-ẹ udecho kw'abẹ, ọttạra odecho kw'akpongnạng. Mạna wọ kw'Jẹphta ọkpaakhẹ adạkhẹ itọhnga s'wạra ọkpaakhẹ k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kha Mizpa.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Osenga ma, Jẹphta ọtọhm akpaakh-nkkaabha p'ata abạbh ọvaarnạng kw'anạng p'Ammọn bẹ́, “Ipina chaam ede yạn kw'n'arima ẹkhạma chaam abẹ o?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Wa Ọvaarnạng kw'anạng p'Ammọn ubhin akpaakh-nkkaabha mbọ p'Jẹphta bẹ́, “Masẹ wa anạng p'Israẹl abin kha Ijip akwu, abẹ atạk isisek saam tạma k'ọraanga kw'Arnọn tạrr, akpira k'ọraanga kw'Jabọk tạrr, oseng ukpira k'ọraanga kw'Jọrdan. Abạnga atte sẹ ọbọhk anạng-m k'ẹmẹm mantọhmma.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Wa Jẹphta ọtọhmọ akpaakh-nkkaabha akpa nnạm k'ọvaarnạng kw'anạng p'Ammọn, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />oben bẹ́:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JDG 11:15">“ Mama wọ ode udik kw'amma Jẹphta mkpaakhẹ bẹ́: anạng p'Israẹl isisek s'Moab, ọbạra ode isisek s'anạng p'Ammọn nátạkha. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Okhenkha, okpe kw'uwa abẹ abin k'Ijip, abẹ asengi k'ukhubha kw'anạng nạn narukha akpira k'Ẹraanga-khora, aseng afona kha Kadẹsh. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl atọhmọ akpaakh-nkkaabha k'ọvaarnạng kw'Edom, aben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Gbe mạna ẹmma anseng k'ẹkhạma chọ amfona,’ okhenka, ọvaarnạng kw'Edom bẹ itọhng nọ́khọhma. Wa abẹ agba atọhm ẹkkaabha anạng ọvaarnạng kw'Moab, ọvaarnạng kw'Moab ufhum. Osenga ma, anạng p'Israẹl n'akpong ma aninga kha Kadẹsh.<verse eid="JDG 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Wa s'abẹ abin ma, abẹ asengi k'uminkpa, k'ọkhaan-ọkhaan kw'Edom, ọttạra Moab. Abẹ asenga udumudum k'ukhubha kw'okpebha-dudon k'ẹkhạma ch'Moab, ata abhing k'ọraanga-ukhubha kw'Arnọn. Wa abẹ k'ẹkhạma ch'Moab nánwa, s'uwa Arnọn ode erem chabẹ.<verse eid="JDG 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />“Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl atọhmọ akpaakh-nkkaabha kha Sihon kw'ode ọvaarnạng k'ẹkhạma ch'Amọr, kw'ọdạbhẹ ẹvaar kha Hẹshbọn, aben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Gbe mạna ẹmma anseng k'ẹkhạma chọ amfona k'amạna k'ofhon.” <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Wa Sihon ọkhaam ojora k'anạng p'Israẹl, ẹgwọ n'nóchera abẹ aseng k'ẹkhạma chẹ. Wa ọtọhmọ akpongnạng pẹ ata abhing kha Jahaz, arima anạng p'Israẹl abẹ.<verse eid="JDG 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />“Osenga ma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl, ọtạkha Sihon ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ phyibh oge anạng p'Israẹl k'mbọhk, abẹ akhema bẹ. Wa anạng p'Israẹl atạk isisek phyibh s'anạng p'Amọr p'uwa arukhu ma k'ẹkhạma njọ. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Wa abẹ atạm mạma k'Arnọn, atạkha isisek phyibh s'anạng p'Amọr tạrr, akpira kha Jabọk, ọttạra k'uminkpa tạrr, aseng akpira kha Jọrdan.<verse eid="JDG 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />“Masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl, kk'anạng p'Amọr ubukha k'ititikha s'anạng pẹ Israẹl, bạng ẹfa jọ ch'ọma akhaam bẹ́, abạra akpa nnạm atạkha sẹ o? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />De Kẹmọsh kw'ode ọkha fabạnga, ọnạngẹ bạnga ọttọhk, abạnga matạkha? Mạnna wọ akwẹ ode oseng k'amạna bẹ́, ọttọhk fidede f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna ọnạngẹ mạna, m'antạkha-ọtạkha. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Ọma ajibhi ayọhnga Balak kw'ode nnwa kw'Zipọr, kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Moab? S'akwẹ obobe ode, kk'ẹkhọhr ọkhaama anạng p'Israẹl abẹ, bạrasẹ n'ukpir kw'm'urima bẹ abẹ? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />K'icho arạbh chi ẹwọ kw'anạng p'Israẹl arukhu kha Hẹshbọn ọttạra kha Aroa, ọttạra kha ifhon s'ining ibaabha bẹ, ọttạra kha ifhon-va phyibh s'ining k'ọkkaden udumudum s'n'atena k'Arnọn. Bạng ọttọhk vọ ọkpa bạra abạnga nạn sẹ nátạkha ma okpe ngwọ. <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Amma kọ ipyibha nạ́nsia. Okhenkha, ọma wọ n'atera asi ipyibha bẹ́ arima abamẹ. Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ọkpaar-aponga, ọkpaara iponga s'anạng p'Israẹl ọttạra anạng p'Ammọn chemma.”<verse eid="JDG 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Ọvaarnạng kw'Ammọn itọhng nọ́khọma k'ẹkkaabha njọ ch'Jẹphta ọtọhmọ ọnạng-ẹ.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Ma wọ, wa ọkpaakpa s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ch'ẹfa inwa Jẹphta. Ojekha ofona kha ẹkhạma ch'Gilead ọttạra kha Manasẹ, oseng kha Mizpa kw'Gilead, ọta urima anạng p'Ammọn abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Wa Jẹphta ọtạk ẹchekha ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Ode atte anạng p'Ammọn ọbọhk anạng-m, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />masẹ m'mmạna s'nkhem anạng p'Ammọn, ọttọhk fidede f'uchi eden ubina kha ọchọhm kwaam ukwu orobh-m, apfẹ m'ode f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, m'bạra ntima pfẹ mfọhnọ ẹja ẹkkạmachẹ.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Masẹ Jẹphta ofon ọta urima anạng p'Ammọn abẹ, wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi otte anạng mbọ ọbọhk ọnạng-ẹ. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Wa Jẹphta udimi ifhon ẹrạbh tạma k'Aroar kpira k'ukhubha kw'Minit tạrr, akpira k'Abẹl-Keramim. Oche ngwọ wọ kw'Israẹl utim okhema anạng p'Ammọn.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Masẹ Jẹphta ukpir k'ọchọhm kwẹ k'Mizpa, wa ọnạng kw'uyini k'iyaan kòde, oyonga uminanwa kwẹ kw'ode nnwa mạnkkeni kw'ọkhaam, kw'utubhu ibin otor k'ukhira kw'achang-kpakpa. Nnwa ọdwạkh-ọdwạk kw'ujunung ọbạra ode kw'ikwanạng kọ́khaam. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Masẹ otte usiẹ-ẹ, ọyaakhẹ ekpo py'oge k'ifor, ọgạma oben bẹ́, “Chakhokho o, nnwa kwaam! Kk'aam afha e! Amma kk'echekha ntạkha k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ch'nạn adạkhẹ mạ́nkke mvọhkhọ.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Nnwa nwọ ọpọhna bẹ́, “Otte kwaam o, ọma kk'echekha atạkha anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Tim-m si k'oche kw'kk'echekha atạkha, masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'anạng p'Ammọn, p'ade awawunanạng pọ, okhema ọnạng-ọ. <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Okhenkha uchini otte bẹ́, “Totokhạn nạng-m aphye afa, ọfha ntwạn ọttạra ayok-mina paam ansenga angạma ambaabha akpechọ, ukwuru samma m'mpe ndimi, udim f'n'mba.”<verse eid="JDG 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Otte ochera, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma sọhng.” Uttiẹ-ẹ ọbọhk ofona k'aphye afa. Ẹma ọttạra ayok-mina pẹ afona ata agạma k'akpechọ, ukwuru s'm'ope udimi, s'n'udim n'ọba. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Masẹ aphye mbọ afa kk'agba, uminanwa nwọ ukwuna otor otte, otte o usiẹ-ẹ k'oche kw'ọtạk echekha. Wa uminanwa nwọ ujunung k'osong.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Akwẹ ọtạma mạma, ode masẹ ẹmaana ch'anạng p'Israẹl, <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />k'cho kw'idede, aminava p'Israẹl n'afona k'iwu innẹbung atima imạmạnna s'uminanwa kw'Jẹphta, kw'ubin Gilead.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ọmmaphyaangẹ kw'Jẹphta ọttạra anạng p'Ephraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Wa anạng p'Ephraim atobh akpongnạng pabẹ, abẹ ajekha k'ukhubha afona k'Zaphon. Abẹ ata abạbh Jẹphta bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'ata arima anạng p'Ammọn abẹ, kw'nạn mạna náyera antwạn abọ-o? Amạna mankkạm-ọ ọttạra ọchọhm kwọ.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Jẹphta ubhin bẹ́, “Irima ch'amma ọttạra anạng paam annim anạng p'Ammọn abẹ, ede irima ch'ẹkpọhkh-ọkpọhkhọ. chibhi s'nyeri bạnga, abạnga k'haam k'mbọhk sabẹ nákaana. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Masẹ nse bẹ́, abạnga khaam mákaana, amma nchera obo njekha nta nnima anạng p'Ammọn abẹ. Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi-m nkhema bẹ. Mantọhmma ode yạn kw'abạnga akwu chemma bẹ́, arima abamẹ o?”<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Wa Jẹphta n'oyeri anạng p'Gilead otobha, utima bẹ ota urima anạng p'Ephraim abẹ. Wa anạng p'Gilead afhọ anạng p'Ephraim, ukwuru s'uwa anạng p'Ephraim kk'abena bẹ́ “Abạngama anạng p'Gilead ade arạbh-ekpong p'abin Ephraim ọttạra Manasẹ.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Wa anạng p'Gilead akpa igbin-gbini s'ọraanga kw'Jọrdan s'm'ajekha Ephraim. K'okpe kw'idede kw'ọnạng kw'Ephraim arạbh-ọ ọnnaanga, obeni bẹ́ “Tte njekha k'ukhubha,” ajunung p'Gilead abạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma abin Ephraim o?” Ode ubhin bẹ́,“Mma,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />abẹ aben-ẹ bẹ́ “Ode mạna ben bẹ́, ‘Shibolẹt.’ ” Ode obeni bẹ́, Sibolẹt,’ ”ukwuru bẹ k'okke oyeri k'ọyọhng ngwọmma obengana, abẹ m'avạkh-ẹ afhọ mạmma k'igbin-gbini s'm'akwu ajekha ọraanga kw'Jọrdan. Anạng nnọhna arạbh-afa ukuma chi p'Ephraim, bọ wa abẹ afhọ ma.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Jẹphta wa ode ọkpaara aponga kw'Israẹl k'icho isajạnẹ. Wa Jẹphta kw'ubin k'ẹkhạma ch'Gilead ope, abẹ anọhng-ẹ k'ofhon gwạnọ kha Gilead.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibzan ọttạra Ẹlọn ọttạra Abdọn, akpaara aponga p'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Masẹ Jẹphta kk'upua, Ibzan kw'ubin Bẹtẹlẹhẹm, ukwu ode ọkpaara akponga k'Israẹl. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Wa ẹma ọkhaam adikkobh ẹrạbh ukuma jobh ọttạra aminava ẹrạbh ukuma jobh. Wa ọtạkha aminava pẹ ọnạng nnạmma idwạk-ọdwạk k'ọbada, ọbạra ọtạ ọtạkha aminava ẹrạbh ukuma jobh k'nnạmma idwạk-ọdwạk okkena adikkobh pẹ k'obada. Wa Ibzan ode ọkpaar-aponga k'Israẹl k'icho isenọfa. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Wa Ibzan ope, abẹ annọhng-ẹ k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Masẹ Ibzan kk'upua, Ẹlọn kw'ubin Zẹbulun, ode ọkpaara aponga kw'Israẹl k'icho jobh. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Wa Ẹlọn ope, abẹ annọhng-ẹ kha Ayijalọn k'ẹkhạma ch'zebulun.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Masẹ Ẹlọn kk'upua, Abdọn kw'ode nnwa kw'Hilẹl kw'ubin Piraton, ukwu ode ọkpaara-aponga k'Israẹl. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Wa ẹma ọkhaam adikkobh arạbh afa ọttạra adikkobh ẹrạbh ukuma jobh p'iva-mfhona, p'ạbẹ n'ayaar k'nnyạnyaang arạbh attaan ukuma jobh. Wa ẹma ode ọkpaara-aponga k'Israẹl k'icho isenọttaan. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Wa Abdọn kw'ode nnwa kw'Hilẹl ope, abẹ annọhng-ẹ k'Piraton kha ẹkhạma ch'Ephraim, k'ukhubha kw'efhondiden ch'okpecho kw'anạng p'Amalẹk.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ẹmmaana ch'Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl abạra asi ibyibyiadik k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi osenga ma, otte bẹ ọbọhk, abẹ aninga k'isekh-isek kw'aPhilistiya k'icho arạbh afa.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Wa ujunung mạnna wạnọ kw'okpen Manoa, kw'ubin Zora, k'ẹkhạma ch'Dan, ọkhaam ikwanạng kw'ode ujidim nnwa nọ́mmaana. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Wa itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi iyini ikhebha ikwanạng nwọ, iben bẹ́, “Ọma ade ujidim, nnwa kákhaam. Okhenkha, ọma m'atima ifhạr, amaan ujunung-nwa. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Khenka songa bẹ́ atwuk mágwo tạrr oseng k'abhinga-twuk. Ọma uchiattọhk f'n'nọ́baana máchi. <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />Ọma m'atima ifhạr amaan ujunung-nnwa kw'ẹgọhbha jạnẹ-jạnẹ nạn khẹ k'echo mítwu mesese, ukwuru bẹ́, udikkobh nwọ m'ode ọNazirit,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">k'eHiburu, ọnạng kw'nạn itwuk-kpọhkha k'nógwo, kw'ẹgọhbha jạnẹ-jạnẹ nạn isisira sẹ mesese mítwu, abẹ ayer-ẹ Nazirit.</char></note> m'ode nnwa kw'abẹ atạm k'ẹfhạr atte ọbọhk anạng Ubinọkpaabyi. Ẹma wọ m'utima anạng eden, ọrạbha anạng p'Israẹl k'mbọhk s'Philistiya.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Wa ikwanạng nwọ ofon ọta okpaak udim kwẹ bẹ́, “Usi-ẹyaakaha kw'Ubinọkpaabyi uyini okhebh-m. Ẹma oyeni okher-m Itọhmọ s'Ubinọkpaabyi s'ipe-m ifor mạnna a. Amma khẹ ibyi s'ubin ukwu nạ́mbạbha, ẹma oyeni khaam eche chẹ nọ́bạra ọkpaakha. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Okhenkha oben-m bẹ́, “Ọma m'atima ifhạr amaan ujunung-nwa. Ma o, atwuk mágwo, tạrr oseng k'abhinga-twuk. Uchiattọhk f'n'nọ́baana mábạra achi, ukwuru bẹ́, udikkobh nwọ m'ode ọNazirit, m'ode nnwa kw'abẹ atạm k'ẹfhạr atte ọbọhk anạng Ubinọkpaabyi tạrr, ukpira k'ebowu chẹ.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Ma wọ Manoa ose njọhm ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́: O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, se amma ọttọhmnạng kwọ ikwosi. Amma n'nchin-ọ-uchini bẹ́, atte ittọhmọ sọ kw'wara attọhmọ akkena mạna ọbọhk ibạra ikpa nnạm ikwu ọfha ọtọhn mạna oche kw'm'ansenga annạk udikkobh-nwa nwọ kw'm'ọmmaana.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhaang njọhm s'Manoa. Itọhmọ s'Ubinọkpaabyi iyin adạkhẹ ikhebha ikwanạng nwọ s'uning kha owonu; okhenka, wa udim kwẹ Manoa mạma kòde. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Ikwanạng nwọ ọrạbh ọta ọkpaak udim bẹ́, “Ujunung nwọ ttạng kw'iwu njọ uyini okhebh-m, kk'adạkhẹ ukwua e!”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa ubina otor ikwanạng kwẹ nnạm. Masẹ ukwu okhebha ujunung nwọ, ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma wọ ade ujunung kw'iwu njọ akpaakhẹ ikwanạng kwaam udik?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Ubhina bẹ́, “Uwe e, amma wọ e.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Ma wọ Manoa ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Okpe kw'itọhnga sọ m'ikhaama ẹyaakha, bạng inyina jọ ch'udikkobh nwọ m'uruk akpen otor, ọbạra usi ọtọhm otor?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Wa itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ibhin bẹ́, “Oyonga ikwanạng kwọ m'usi idik sidede phyi-phyibh s'kk'ẹ mkpaakha bẹ́ usi. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Nọ́baana bẹ́ uchi fidede f'ubin k'grep, nọ́baana bẹ́ ogwo atwuk bạnọ-bạnọ, oseng k'abhinga-twuk, nọ́baana bẹ́ uchi unyina-ttọhk. Oyonga m'usi fidede f'kk'ẹ ntọhna bẹ́ usi.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa oben itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Wạra ọdaakhẹ mạna bẹ́, ọma aninga mạna abẹ mama tạrr, ankkạng uvu-nwa annạng-ọ.”<verse eid="JDG 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Itọhmọ nnọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ibhin bẹ́, “Ọbạra avạkh-m achok ma, amma uchiattọhk vạnọ-vạnọ f'abạnga mạ́nchi. Khenka fọhnọ ẹja ẹkkạmachẹ nạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.” (Wa Manoa nútina bẹ́, itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi rọ.)<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Wa Manoa ọbạbhọ itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Ọma akpen yạn o, ọfha annạng-ọ ikpukpobha k'okpe kw'ọtọhnga kwọ m'ọkhaama ẹyaakha k'udik-ọkka?”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ibhin bẹ́, “Asi yạn abạbh-m eche? Akwẹ khọ mọ́ttaanẹ e.” <verse eid="JDG 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Ma wọ Manoa ọtạk uvu-nwa ọttạra k'ẹnạnga ch'agwu, utima ọfọhnọ ẹja k'ẹtakpa ẹrạng-ẹrạng ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Mạnna wọ kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi ikkkukkona-dik s'Manoa ọttạra ikwa ase. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Masẹ akpondaak ayạm k'ijabyi atena k'ẹrạng, itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi isenga k'akpondaak mbọ ifona. Masẹ Manoa ọttạra ikwa ase udik ngwa, abẹ atto akhubha utitikha fabẹ k'isisek. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Masẹ itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nạn adạkhẹ níyina ikhebha Manoa ọttạra ikwa, mạma wọ Manoa n'utini bẹ́, itọhmọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ẹrọ ma.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Manoa oben ikwa bẹ́, “Amạna kk'ampua e, amạna kk'Ubinọkpaabyi ansia e!”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Okhenkha, ikwanạng kwẹ ọpọhn bẹ́, “Ode wạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkhạmọ bẹ́ ọfhọ mạna, wạra ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ ọttạra k'ẹnạnga chamạna ch'agwu k'mbọhk samạna mọ́tạkha. Wạra mạna idik nna phyibh mọ́khọhkha, wạra mạna sẹ kpạ-kpaak mọ́kpaak bạra.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Ikwanạng nwọ wa ukwu ọmaan ujunung-nwa, ukpẹ-ẹ Samson. Wa nnwa nwọ ọbạrẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udi-ẹ. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Wa Iguguma s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi s'ẹfa inwẹ-ẹ s'uning kha Mahane-dan, k'ngekha kw'Zora ọttạra Ẹshtaol.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ọbada kw'Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Wa Samson ọta kha Timna, ọta ose uminanwa wạnọ kw'ubin Philistiya. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Masẹ ukwun o, n'ọta ọkpaak otte ọttạra ọkka bẹ́, “Amma k'oPhilistiya-kwanạng nsia kha Timna; abạnga atạkh-ẹ anạng-m ode ikwanạng kwaam.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Otte ọttạra ọkka abhin bẹ́, “N'ode bẹ́ aminava akkapẹ nawor-owor k'ichimma chọ tạrr, oseng ẹkhạma ch'anạng pamạna, kw'ọma n'afon k'anạng p'Philistiya, p'nạn ọkpọkkrọkkọ násia bẹ́, ata atạkha ikwanạng o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Tạrr oseng ma, Samson obeni otte bẹ́, “Ẹma nwọ wọ ọdaakhẹ amma. Atạkh-ẹ anạng-m, mba.” <verse eid="JDG 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />(Wa otte ọttạra ọkka kásong bẹ́ akwẹ ubin k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'n'oben bẹ́ osenga ma, ọnạng aPhilistiya irem; ukwuru bẹ́ wa anạng p'Israẹl aning k'isekhisek kw'abẹ.)<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Ma wọ Samson utim otte ọttạra ọkka ofona kha Timna. Masẹ sabẹ akpir k'iwonu s'agrep k'ofhon kw'Timna, ekke iyin mạma n'isi ẹmạng, n'esenga efora Samson. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Iguguma s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi s'ẹfa inwa Samson inạng-ẹ ẹfa ch'utim mbọhk-mbọhk ọvạkha ekke ọyaakhẹ, aben bẹ́ ọyaakhẹ uvu-nwa. Okhenkha, ẹma wa otte ọttạra ọkka udik kw'kk'usia nọ́kpaakha. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Osenga ọsạkha okhebha ikwanạng nwọ, abẹ akpaak idik, ukwu ọkhaama ikwanạng nwọ abẹ idạdaakha.<verse eid="JDG 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Masẹ ọkpa nnạm k'okpe ọdwạkh-ọdwạk bẹ́ ọta usi ọbada k'ọkwanạng-nwa nwọ, n'ọbhạkhẹ ichen okkeri k'ibyi s'okke-bukhu iyim, n'ose s'akhọhn-kpa ọttạra ọkhọhn kha okke-bukhu ẹtaanga. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Ukwu onemi ọbọhk ọgwọhngọ ọkhọhn mvọ, n'ọttaakhẹ otor eden. Masẹ ofon ọta okhebha ọkka ọttạra otte, ọtạkha ọkhọhn mvọ ọnạng bẹ, abẹ attaakhẹ attạra, okhenka, wa bẹ nọ́kpaakha bẹ́, ọtạk pfẹ k'okke-bukhu.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Wa otte otte ọtwạnọ abẹ, abẹ ata k'uminanwa nwọ. Samson usi erobha ch'ọbada ma otor k'ẹmmaana ch'adikkobh-va. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Masẹ anạng p'Philistiya asiẹ-ẹ, abẹ atekha adikkobh anạng ẹrạbh ukuma jobh anạng-ẹ, masẹ ayokh-ikhaana pẹ.<verse eid="JDG 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Wa samson obeni bẹ bẹ́, “Tte ntta bạnga oche. Ode abạnga m'akke anạng-m ẹyaakha ch'oche ngwa k'iwu nna isenọfa s'erobha nja, amma m'nnạng bạnga anọhma-baba ẹrạbh ukuma jobh p'abẹ atim ndikhi ọkkakka ayok, ọttạra ọvạra-cho ẹrạbh ukuma jobh. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />De abạnga nạn khaam ẹyaakha nákkia anạng, oyonga abạnga m'anạng-m anọhma-baba ẹrạbh ukuma jobh p'abẹ atim ndikhi ọkkọkka ayok, ọttạra ọvạra-cho ẹrạbh ukuma jobh.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Adikkobh-va mba abhina bẹ́, “Tte mạna oche ngwọ ammaanga kh'anse.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Samson ọbẹ́:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">Uchiattọhk ubin k'ọnạng kw'uchi ọttọhk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:14">Orebh ubin k'ọnạng kw'ọkhaam ẹfa.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">K'iwu ittaan, abẹ ẹyaakha ch'oche ngwọ nákkia anạng.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Ottong iwu innebung, abẹ ata aben ikwanạng kw'Samson aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Bọhra udim ọkpaak mạna oche kw'oche kwẹ uyini, deja, m'ankkạmọ ọma ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr ch'atte phyibh e. Abạnga abheri mạna bẹ́ abạnga akwu afu mạna ekpo?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Ma wọ ikwanạng kw'Samson otto ọbạnga udim ma k'ifor, n'ọgạma oben bẹ́, “Amma khọ nạ́ndaakha! Idạdaakha rạnẹ-rạnẹ kákhaam abamẹ! Kk'anạng paam oche atta, okhenka, khaam ẹyaakha ch'oche ngwọ tạm nánạnga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Samson ọpọhn bẹ́, “Amma otte ọttạra ọkka kwaam tạm nạ́ntekha k'oche kw'akwẹ uyini, m'nsi yạn ntek ọma o?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Wa ọgạm ẹmạng njọ k'iwu nnọ isenọfa phyibh s'erobha. Ottong iwu isenọfa nnọ, Samson n'otekh-ẹ oche kw'oche ngwọ uyini, ukwuru s'ofon ororo ọkpạn-ẹ. Mạnna wọ ikwanạng nwọ ọbhạkhẹ usi ẹyaakha ch'oche ngwọ, ọnạng anạng pẹ.<verse eid="JDG 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Bạrasẹ n'ukpir k'ẹchọhkha ch'iwu njọ ch'ettong iwu isenọfa, ajunung p'ofhon ngwọ abeni Samson bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Mbạng vọ f'orebhi oyọhnga ọkhọhn o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">Mbạng vọ f'ọkhaam ẹfa ọyọhnga ekke o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">Samson n'obeni bẹ bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Ode wạra abạnga nạn ikwanạng kwaam k'ẹfa návạkha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">wạra ọnạng kw'm'utin oche kwaam kòde.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Ma wọ ọkpaakpa s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ch'ẹfa inwa Samson. Osenga ọsạkha kha Ashkẹlọn, ọta ọfhọ anạng ẹrạbh ukuma jobh k'ajunung pabẹ. Ọwạra bẹ ekpo phyibh, ọtạkha pyẹ ọta ọnạng anạng ajunung mbọ ma p'atini oche kwẹ. Utima idwạdwạkhọ ọkpa nnạm, ọbhạna k'otte k'ọchọhm. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Wa abẹ atạk ikwanạng kw'Samson, anạng udikkobh wạnọ ma k'ikhaana nnọ s'uwa isi erobha ch'ọbada kw'Samson.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s1">Samson okhem anạng Philistiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />K'okpe ma, k'ọphyakpe kw'wit, wa Samson utim uvu-nwa bẹ́, ọta udibh ikwanạng kwẹ. Obeni bẹ́, “Amma m'nta kha ẹmaanggọ ch'ikwanạng kwaam e.” Okhenkha, wa otte kw'ikwa nóchera bẹ́ ọnwa kha ẹmaanggọ ẹtaanga.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Wa otte kw'ikwa obeni bẹ́, “Amma wa nkkẹ bẹ́ uminanwa nwọ khọ nọ́daakha, ẹgwọ usi ntạkh-ẹ nnạng oyokh-udikkobh kwọ. Nnwọkka kw'otor-ẹ nnạm sạng kw'otera ujibh ọyọhnga ẹma nwọ? Tạkha oyok nwọ ọ.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Wa Samson obeni bẹ bẹ́, “Okpe ngwa, iponga dạk khaam mípyibh k'udik kw'm'nsi aPhilistiya mba; m'nkhaankẹ nsi bẹ udik.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Mạnna wọ ofona ọta ọvakha asi arạbh chi, ọtạkha pyẹ ọdạbh k'afa-k'afa, ẹsạra ọttạra ẹsạra. Ọtạkha ikhebh ọdạbh k'nsạra mfa sidede. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Ọtạkha okhebh mbọ oyeni, bạrasẹ n'otte asi mbọ ọbọhk inwa k'iwonu s'awit p'anạng p'Philistiya. Ọkkạmọ awit p'abẹ aye-oye, ọttạra p'atim abe k'iwonu s'agrep, ọttạra s'oliv.<verse eid="JDG 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />K'okpe kw'aPhilistiya n'abạbhọ bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ usi udik demankwẹ ngwa?” Abẹ akpaak bẹ bẹ́, “Samson kw'ode ọnyẹ kw'ujunung kw'ubin Timnit ẹwọ usi udik ngwa ma e, ukwuru s'abẹ atạk ikwanạng kwẹ anạng oyokh-udikkobh kwẹ e.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:6">Ma wọ anạng p'Philistiya afon ata akkạmọ umina-nnwa nwọ ọttạra otte, abẹ apẹ. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samson oben bẹ bẹ́, “Masẹ abạnga n'asi oche ngwa, amma nchekhi bẹ́, ọyọhn mạ́nkwokha tạrr, ntera udik ngwa kw'abạnga asi mama <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Wa utim ottem-pyibh urima bẹ abẹ, ọfhọ bẹ k'ọsaabh. Ubina ọta uninga kha ẹtakpa-ma ch'Etam.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Wa anạng p'Pilistiya ata abhing kha Juda, abẹ anyaamẹ akpira kha Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Wa anạng p'Juda n'abạbhọ bẹ bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'abạnga akwu bẹ́ akwu arima mạna abẹ o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Abẹ abhina bẹ́, “Kk'ankwua bẹ́, ankwu avạkha Samson anta ange mgbakkọhbhọ, m'ansiẹ-ẹ oche kw'usi mạna.”<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Ma wọ anạng p'Juda nnọhna nsenọfa ukuma arạbh jobh, asạk k'ẹtakpa-mma kw'Etam ata aben Samson bẹ́, “N'ode bẹ́ ọma kásọng bẹ́, amạna mba aning k'isekh-isek s'anạng p'Philistiya? Bạng udik gwọ kw'asi mạna ma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">“Ubhina bẹ́, “Amma nkhenka ntera udik kw'abẹ asi-m e.”<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Ma wọ abẹ aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Amạna kk'ankwua bẹ́, ankwu adạbh-ọ, antọhkh-ọ ankkena anạng p'Philistiya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samson oben bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga achekhi anạng-m bẹ́, abạnga khaam máfhọ.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Abẹ abhina bẹ́, “Amạna mba kk'anchera. Amạna khọ mámfhọ, m'ankhenkha andạbh-ọ, antọhkh-ọ ankkena bẹ.” Ma wọ kw'abẹ atim ndikhi ibhasẹ mfa adạbh-ẹ, atim-ẹ ayin ma k'ẹtakpa njọ. <verse eid="JDG 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Masẹ abẹ akpir kha Lehi, anạng p'Philistiya n'awur ẹmạng, asenga akhebh-ẹ. Ma wọ ọkpaakpa s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ẹsạk ẹnwẹ-ẹ, ẹnạng-ẹ ẹfa. Ndikhi s'abẹ adạbhẹ k'mbọhk, ikpaara masẹ ndikhi-bukhu s'ekpon ẹkkạmọ, ichaar-ẹ kha mbọhk, itto. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Ma wọ udwung ọkhạbhọ kw'agba p'ẹnyanyaang kw'ose mạma, utima ọfhọ anạng nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh.<verse eid="JDG 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Ma o, Samson ọbẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">“Amma kk'ọkhạbhọ kw'agba p'ẹnyạnyaang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">ntima nsi bẹ masẹ nnyạnyaang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">Amma kk'ọkhạbhọ kw'agba p'ẹnyanyaang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">ntima mfhọ ajunung nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Masẹ kk'ọkpaakha phyibh, ọtạkha ọkhạbhọ nwọ kw'agba p'ẹnyạnyaang ọbhạrẹ; wa abẹ ayeri ibyi nnọ Ramat-Lehi.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Wa asi kk'ẹ daakha mororo, ọgạma oyeri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, oben bẹ́, “Ọma kk'amma ọtọhmnạng kwọ ekhema chididen anạnga. Ma, n'abạra nsenga isi-dạkha achẹ nta mpe k'mbọhk s'ạnạng p'nạn ọkpọkkrọkkọ asi o?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Ma wọ Ubinọkpaabyi usi asi amaam ayin k'ẹmma ch'eje ch'ining k'isisek s'Lehi. Masẹ Samson ogwo asi mbọ, ifor ikpọkh-ẹ, ọbạra ọkhaama ẹfa. Ma wọ abẹ ayeri efhobh njọ, Ẹn-Hakore, p'itim ining kha Lehi ttạra ukpira chemma.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Wa Samson ode ọkpaar-aponga k'Israẹl k'icho ẹrạbh, k'okpe kw'uwa anạng p'Philistiya adạbhẹ bẹ.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s1">Samson ọttạra Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />K'iwu mạnna jạnẹ, Samson oseng otena k'ukhubha kw'Gaza k'ẹkhạma ch'Philistiya. Ukwu ose ọsaasa-kwanạng, ofona okhebh-ẹ ọta ubhing abẹ ma irungu njọ. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Wa abẹ akpaakhẹ anạng p'Gaza bẹ́, Samson uning mạma. Ma wọ kw'anạng p'Gaza afon ata ayeri ajunung atobha, abẹ ayima abaabha ẹbaakha-mma ch'ofhon ma irungu njọ phyibh, atik. Abẹ aning <char style="it">bẹ́ ttọọhng</char> ma irungu njọ, n'aben ayok bẹ́, “M'amfhẹ-ẹ de iwu kk'echobha.”<verse eid="JDG 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Okhenkha, wa Samson uyim mạma ttạr, ukpira k'urunguttem. Ubin ma urunguttem <char style="it">bẹ́ bikk</char> ọta ọvạkha ammakhubh p'ẹbaakhamma p'ofhon, ọmaana k'mkpọmmachi afa, ọsạbhọ, ukwu ọttạra k'agbạkhọhrọ, ọttạra ekpo phyi-phyibh py'ẹbaakhamma. Udira pyẹ ọnạna k'nkkang, utima uvura okpecho kha ẹrạng, k'ukhubha kw'okkeri Hẹbrọn ititikha.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />K'okpe ma, wa ikwanạng wạnọ kw'okpen Delila ọdaakhẹ ẹma Samson k'Ipekhuma s'Sorẹk. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Wa anạng p'adạbhẹ Philistiya ata akhebha ikwanạng nwọ aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Bọhra Samson, ọfha ọkpakh-ọ ọtaanga kw'ẹfa chẹ, ọfha annẹ-ẹ ẹfa, ọfha ambạra andạbh-ẹ ndikhi, ankhem-ẹ. Ọnạng-ọnạng ma k'amạna k'ikhaana m'ọnạng-ọ ashẹkẹl p'silva nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh chi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Mạnna wọ Delila ọta oben Samson bẹ́, “Kpaakh-m ọtaanga kw'ẹfa chọ, ọttạra k'oche kw'ọnạng m'okke-okke ọdạbh-ọ ndikhi, okhem-ọ.”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samson ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Ode ọnạng kwidede utim adikhi-naaga asenọfa p'ade ikhikhebhi ọdạbh-m, ma wọ ẹfa m'ẹsa-m oche kw'n'ẹsa ujunung ujunung kwidede.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Osenga ma, adạbhẹ p'anạng p'Philistiya atạkha adikhi-naaga asenọfa akhikhebhi, akkena ikwanạng nwọ, utima sẹ ọdạbh-ẹ. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />N'ode s'ajunung kk'akwua, akwu attubha ma ẹmaanggọ ẹtaanga. Ma wọ ikwanạng nwọ oyer-ẹ bẹ́, “Samson o, anạng p'Philistiya bạra avạkh-ọ e!” Ma wọ ọvạk ndikhi nnọ ọkpaara <char style="it">bẹ́ tteng</char> masẹ idikhi ch'abẹ ason k'ekpon. Wa abẹ ọtaanga kw'ẹfa chẹ nákkia asonga.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Wa Delila obeni Samson bẹ́, “Kk'aam asia nkhera udindingi-nạng, kk'aam afhạra asia. Kpaakh-m ukhira kw'ọnạng m'osenga ọdạbh-ọ.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Oben bẹ́, “Ode ọnạng utim ndikhi ibhasẹ ọdạbh-m mororo, ẹfa m'ẹsa-m oche kw'n'ẹsa ujunung kwidede.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Ma wọ Delila ọtạk ndikhi ibhasẹ utima ọdạbh-ẹ. N'ode s'ajunung kk'akwua akwu attubha k'akh-ẹ k'ẹmaanggọ ẹtaanga. Ikwanạng nwọ oyeri, “Samson o, anạng p'Philistiya n'abạra avạkhọ e!” Ma wọ ọvạk ndikhi sabẹ adạbh-ẹ k'mbọhk ọsạbhọ, masẹ adikhi-naaga.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Wa Delila obeni Samson bẹ́, “Ọma atim atạkh-m masẹ udindingi-nạng, n'asi-m afhạra. Kpaakh-m oche kw'ọnạng m'osenga ọdạbh-ọ khadẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Samson ubhina bẹ́, “Ode atạk akpọdim mba asenọfa p'aning-m ma k'echo, atima udikhi-naanga ateng pyẹ, abạra atima mkpạkha agba pyẹ, ẹfa m'ẹsa-m oche kw'n'ẹsa ujunung kwidede.” Ma o, masẹ Samson n'ọttaabha ọda, Delila ọtạkha akpọdim mbọ asenọfa py'echo ch'Samson oteng, <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />obạra utima mkpạkha ọgba pyẹ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:14">Ma wọ ọbạra oyer-ẹ, ọbẹ́, “Samson e, anạng p'Philistiya n'abạra avạkh-ọ e!” Ma wọ ọphyạbh k'ọda, ọrabha mkpạkha, ọbạra ọchaarẹ idikhi-naanga ch'ẹvạk akpọdim mbọ etobha.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Ma wọ Delila oben-ẹ bẹ́, “K'ayạn wọ ọma n'aben bẹ́ amma ndaakh-ọ-ọdaakh, kw'n'náchera ayaakhẹ ọtaanga kwọ anạng-m? N'ode ikpe mạnna ittaan s'kk'aam asia nkhera udidingi, náchera bẹ́ ayaakhẹ ọtaanga kw'ẹfa chọ anạng-m.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Wa Samson obhem-ẹ ipyibha-ipyibha, otena k'ukhira kw'Delila n'utima ọyạkh-ẹ udik, iwu nja echobh-ochobha ẹsa.<verse eid="JDG 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Osenga ma, ọkpaakh-ẹ udik kwidede oben bẹ́, “Egọbha k'akhaam k'echo tạm nítwua, amma nde nnwa kw'abẹ atte ọbọhk tạma k'ifhạr anạng Ubinọkpaabyi. De abẹ aphyir-m isisira, ẹfa m'ẹsa-m oche kw'n'ẹsa ujunung kwidede.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />M'asẹ Delila ose bẹ́, kk'udik-ọkka Samson kk'ẹ udik kwidede ọkpaakha, ọtọhm ẹkkaabha ọnạng adạbh-ẹ p'Philistiya oben bẹ́, “Abạnga akpa nnạm ẹkpa nja; khiri kk'aam udik kwidede ọkpaakha.” Ma wọ adạbhẹ p'Philistiya mbọ atim silva k'mbọhk akwu. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Masẹ kk'ẹ ọbọhra ọttaabha ma k'akhẹ k'ntaak, Delila oyeri ọnạng ukwu uphyiri Samson akpọdim asenọfa pẹ, ma wọ ẹfa ẹsẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="JDG 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Ma o, ikwanạng nwọ oyer-ẹ, “Samson o, anạng p'Philistiya bạra avạkh-ọ e!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:20">Masẹ ọphyạbh, ọkkẹ bẹ́, “Tte nsi oche kw'n'nsi, nchaarẹ amma oyeni.” Okhenkha, wa kósong bẹ́, Ọvaar ubinọkpaabyi kk'ẹ ọbọhk uttia.<verse eid="JDG 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Mạnna wọ anạng p'Philistiya avạkh-ẹ, adwạngọ achen, atim-ẹ afona k'ofhon kw'Gaza. Wa abẹ agbaakh-ẹ mgbakkọhbhọ s'brons, abẹ achokh-ẹ bẹ́, n'ọggọhk-ekpo k'ọgbakkọhbhọ-ter. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Okhenkha, wa isisira sẹ s'echo ibạra itạma mạmen.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obo kw'Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Wa adạbh-ẹ p'Philistiya atobh bẹ́, abẹ afọhnọ ẹja ọkkachẹ anạng Dagọn kw'ode ọkha fabẹ, ọttạra bẹ́, abẹ abạra asi erobha, abẹ n'abeni bẹ́, “Ọkha famạna kk'Samson kw'ode ọwawuna-nạng kwamạna, ọtạkha oge mạna k'mbọhk.”<verse eid="JDG 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Masẹ anạng mbọ asi-ẹ, abẹ atọhnga ọkha fabe, aben bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 16:24">“Ọkha famạna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 16:24">kk'ọwawuna-nạng kwamạna ọtạkha oge mạna k'mbọhk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 16:24">kw'oge isisek samạna k'dạmadạma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 16:24">obạra ofhọ mạna k'ọsaabh.”<verse eid="JDG 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Masẹ abẹ n'asi erọbha njọ, abe aben bẹ́, “Atima Samson ayin kha iyaan, ukwu uyukhu mạna sisi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:25">Wa abẹ ayeri Samson k'ọgbakkọhbhọ-ter, ukwu uyukhu bẹ sisi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:25">Masẹ abẹ achọkh-ẹ k'ngekha kw'mkpọmmachi, <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samson obeni ọtọhmnạng kw'ọvạkh-ẹ bẹ́, “Chokh-m k'ibyi s'm'mvạkha mbọhk k'ntumu s'ivạk ọchọhm ngwa, ọfha mphye mạma.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Wa anạng afu ma k'ọchọhm ngwọ <char style="it">bẹ́ byẹr</char>, ajunung ọttạra ipanạng; wa adạbhẹ p'Philistiya agba aninga mạma, anạng nnọhna nsenọfa ukuma arạbh jobh, ajunung ọttạra ipanạng, abẹ aning n'asẹ oche kw'Samson n'usi. <verse eid="JDG 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Ma wọ, wa Samson ose njọhm oyeri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, oben bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng, jim-m e. Totokhạn, Ubinọkpaabyi, nạng-m adạkhẹ ẹfa ma okpe ngwa gwạnọ, ntima ibadwuk rạnẹ ntima ntera achen paam afa p'anạng p'Philistiya arạbh.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Mạnna wọ kw'Samson ọvạk mbọhk k'ntumu mfa s'ivạk ọchọhm ngwọ k'ngekha. Ọvạkha udimbọhk k'ntumu wạnọ, ọbạra utima ọkwabọhk ọvạkha njọkha. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Samson oben bẹ́, “Tte mpe aPhilistiya abẹ!” Ma wọ Samson utim ẹfa chẹ phyibh unnunu mkpọmmachi nnọ tạrr, ọchọhm ubungukwẹ otto <char style="it">bẹ́ gwạrong</char>, ọkpẹkhẹ adạbhẹ p'Philistiya, ọttạra anạng phyi-phyibh p'aning mạma k'ọchọhm ngwọ ẹtaanga. Wa anạng p'ọfhọ k'okpe kw'ope, ayọhng anạng p'ọfhọ k'okpe kw'urukhu akpen.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Wa ivotte pẹ, ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr ch'otte phyi-phyibh afon ata atạkh-ẹ. Abẹ atim-ẹ akpa nnạm ata anọhnga k'ngekha kw'Zora ọttạra Ẹshtaol, k'epekwur ch'otte Manoa. Ẹma wa ode ọkpaar-aponga k'Israẹl k'icho ẹrạbh.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ọkha f'Mika okpobh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Wa ujunung wạnọ kw'ubin k'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Epraim, kw'okpen Mika, <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />obeni ọkka bẹ́, “Ashekẹl p'silva nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh chi, p'abẹ atạk k'akhọ-ọ k'mbọhk, p'aseng apyẹ anạng ọnạng kw'ọtạk ẹmma-raakha, p'abạra akpaak kwẹ age-m k'itọhng, kkeri pyẹ ma e, amma wọ wa ntạk pyẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Ọkka n'obeni bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udiọ-ọ!”<verse eid="JDG 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Masẹ urikhi ashekẹl mbọ p'silva nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh chi ọnạng ọkka, ọkka n'obeni bẹ́, “K'udik-ọkka, amma m'ntte asilva mbọ paam ọbọhk nnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpabyi, ọfha nnwa kwaam utima usi ọkpạta-nwa kw'abẹ atim silva afhạrọ. Amma m'ntạkha ọkpạta-nwa nwọ mkpa nnạm nnạng-ọ.”<verse eid="JDG 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Masẹ urikhi asilva mbọ ọnạng ọkka, ọkka n'ọtạk ashekẹl arạbh jobh p'silva ọnạng omenkka-nạng kw'silva, kw'utim pyẹ udwuk ọkpata-nwa. Wa abẹ atạk wẹ ata achok k'ọchọhm kw'Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Wa ujunung nwa kw'okpen Mika ọkhaam ọkha-pa, kw'uwa usi ẹphọd ọttạra ikha s'ẹchọhmfhạr, ukwu ọtạkha nnwa wạnọ kwẹ kw'ujunung utima usi ọfọhnẹja kwẹ. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />K'okpe ngwọ, wa anạng p'Israẹl ọvaarnạng kákháam, ọnạng kwidede urukhu oche kw'ọdaakh-ẹ.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Wa udikkobh kw'efonamma ch'Lẹvi, kw'ubin Bẹtẹlẹhẹm kha ẹkhạma ch'Juda, <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />ubin urik Bẹtẹlẹhẹm kha Juda, ọta oror ibyi idwạkh-ọdwạk s'm'uninga. Masẹ n'osenga k'eden, ọta ọyaakha k'ochọhm kw'Mika, k'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Ephraim.<verse eid="JDG 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika ọbọbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma abin mạn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Oben bẹ́, “Amma mbin k'efonamma ch'Lẹvi, kha Bẹtẹlẹhẹm, k'ẹkhạma ch'Juda. Amma n'nnor ibyi s'm'nnuk.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Ma wọ Mika oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọma m'aruk abamẹ mama, ọfha asenga ma ade otte ọttạra ọfọhnẹja kwaam. Amma m'nnạng-ọ ashẹkẹl jobh p'silva k'icho, mbạra nnạng-ọ ọvạra ọttạra uchiattọhk.” Ujunung nwọ kw'efonamma ch'Lẹvi ọnwa kha ẹtaanga. <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Wa udikkobh nwọ kw'Lẹvi ocher bẹ́, uruk abẹ. Udikkobh nwọ o, n'ukwu ode masẹ ujunung-nwa kwẹ wạnọ. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Ma wọ Mika usi udikkobh nwọ kw'Lẹvi ọfọhnẹja kwẹ, ọbạra uruk k'akhẹ k'ọchọhm. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Mika, ọbẹ́, “Amma kk'nsonga bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'usi ijibha usi ọnạng-m, s'udikkobh nwa kw'Lẹvi kk'ọfọhnẹja kwaam udia.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s1">Anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Dan arukhu kha Laish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />K'okpe ngwọ ma, wa anạng p'Israẹl ọvaanạng kákháam.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:1">K'okpe ngwọ, wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Dan n'aror ibyi s'm'ikpena sabẹ, s'abẹ m'akke aruk, ukwuru s'abẹ nạn ekkema ch'ede okhebh f'abẹ tạm nákhaama k'ikhaana s'nkhạma s'Israẹl. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Ma wọ anạng p'Dan atọhmọ akkemkpa pabẹ anạng asen p'abin k'ifhon s'Zora ọttạra Ẹshtaol bẹ́, abẹ ata abana isisek nnọ, abạra asenga abaabha, ase sẹ. Wa ajunung mbọ abe k'ncho s'inạmma s'Dan phyi-phyibh. Abẹ abeni bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga asọhng ata asenga ase ẹkhạma njọ khanse.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:2">Ma wọ abẹ afon ata anwa k'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Ephraim, ata asạkha k'ọchọhm kw'Mika, abhing mạma. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Masẹ abẹ abaang ọchọhm kw'Mika. abẹ atini udikkobh kw'efonamma ch'Lẹvi kk'ọtọhnga; ma wọ, abẹ ata anwa akhebh-ẹ, abạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ utim-ọ ukwu ma? Ọma n'asi mbạng ma k'ibyi nna? Mbạng vọ utim-ọ ukwu ma?<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Ma wọ ọtạk oche kw'Mika kk'usia ọnạng-ẹ ọkpaak bẹ, oben bẹ́, “Kk'aam ọtạkha ọtạkhha k'ọtọhm e, amma wọ nde ọfọhnẹja kwẹ e.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Ma wọ abẹ aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Totokhạn, dwạn Ubinọkpaabyi ọfha ansonga de osenga kw'n'amben bẹ́ amfona ma s'm'ujibh ọnạng mạna.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Ọfọhnẹja nwọ ubhina bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga asọhng k'idira. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'osenga kwabạnga udia.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Mạnna wọ kw'ajunung mbọ asen abin atena Laish, ata ase bẹ́ anạng p'arukhu kha, arukhu k'idira, oche kw'anạng p'Sidọn arukhu k'idira, p'nạn ojora ákhaam. Wa ujibhada uning ma ẹkhạma njọ, ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ kòde f'oworu bẹ. Abẹ abạra aruk abhir eden k'ẹkạma ch'Sidọn, abẹ oforgbạkha wạnọ-wạnọ nákhaam ọttạra anạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />K'ọkpe kw'abẹ kk'akwuna k'ifhon s'Zora, ọttạra Ẹshtaol, ivotte abạbh bẹ bẹ́, “Idik ide yạn bạnga abẹ o?”<verse eid="JDG 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Abẹ abhina bẹ́, “Abạnga akwu, anta annima bẹ abẹ! Khiri amạna kk'ansia bẹ́ isisek nnọ ijibh-ujibh. Abạnga m'atobha mbọhk oche ngwọ? Abạnga okpe kákhibhi, tte amfona anta antạkha isisek nnọ. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Masẹ abạnga m'akpira mạma, abạnga m'akhebha anạng p'arukhu mạma k'isisek nnọ, p'nạn ichen náchokha bẹ́, udik m'uyin-uyin. Ibyi nna ide isisek s'ibạrẹ ẹkpa s'Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọtạkha oge bạnga k'mbọhk, isisek s'nạn ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ níwora.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Ma wọ ajunung ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh p'abin k'ẹkhạma ch'Dan ata ado ifor s'ekpong, abina kha Zora ọttạra Ẹshtaol. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Masẹ abẹ n'asenga k'ọkkaden, abẹ asi ibyibhingasẹ abạnga Kiriyat-Jẹrim k'Juda. Ẹgwọ usi abẹ ayeri ukhubha kw'ochọhkha-dudon kha Kiriyat-Jẹrim, Mahane-Dan tạrr, ukpira k'iwu ch'chemma. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Abẹ abin mạma atena k'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Ephraim, ata asạkha k'ọchọhm kw'Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Ma wọ, ajunung mbọ asen p'kk'ẹkhama ch'Laish ata abana, abạbhọ ivotte pabẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga asong ma bẹ́ ọchọhm gwạnọ k'ngekha kw'ichọhm nna ọkhaam ẹphọd, ọttạra akpatava p'ẹchọhmfhạr, ọttạra akpatava p'abẹ atim silva afhạrọ? Abạnga asong oche ma kw'abạnga m'asi? <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Ma wọ, abẹ abin mạma atena k'ọchọhm kw'Mika ata asima udikkobh kw'Lẹvi. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Ajunung mbọ ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh p'ẹfonamma ch'Dan, p'kk'ekpong-kpo adạbha, ata abe k'ẹbaakhamma ch'ofhon <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Ajunung mbọ asen p'kk'afona ata abana isisek nnọ, anwa kha ẹtaanga ata atạkha ọkpata-nwa, ọttạra ẹphọd, ọttạra akpata-va p'ẹchọhmfhạr, k'okpe kw'ọfọhnẹja ọttạra ajunung mbọ ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh kk'ekpong-kpo adạbha, abe k'ẹbaakhamma ch'ofhon.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Masẹ ajunung mbọ asen anwa k'ọchọhm kw'Mika ata atạkha ọkpata-nnwa, ọttạra ephọd, ọttạra akpata-va p'ẹchọhmfhạr, ọfọhnẹja ọbabhọ bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga n'asi mbạng?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Bẹ abhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Myi <char style="tl">bẹ́ ttọọhng! </char> Udik kákpaak. Tor mạna nnạm, ade mạna otte ọttạra ọfọhnẹja. Nújibha ọyọhnga bẹ́, ade ọfọhnẹja k'ẹkhạma jạnẹ ọttạra k'ẹnạmma jạnẹ ch'Israẹl, ọttạra bẹ́, ade ọfọhnẹja k'ẹchọhmmfạr ch'ujunung wạnọ, yạn wọ ujibhi ọtạm?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Wa ettem erebhi ọfọhnẹja nwọ mororo. Ọtạkha ẹphọd ọttạra akpata-va mbọ p'ẹchọhmfhạr, ọttạra ọkpata-nwa kw'abẹ agwa-ọgwa, otor bẹ nnạm ofona. <verse eid="JDG 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Wa abẹ abhạkhẹ nnạm afona, iva pabẹ, ọttạra itirakpo pyabẹ, ọttạra ẹkhaama chabẹ, achi bẹ eden.<verse eid="JDG 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Masẹ abẹ kk'eden-ibhir afona arik ọchọhm kw'Mika, ajunung p'arukhu abaanga Mika ayeri ayok atobha, abẹ akhubh ata akhạbha anạng p'Dan oro. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Masẹ abẹ ayaanẹ ẹmạng ayeri bẹ, anạng p'Dan abhạkhẹ, aben Mika bẹ́, “Udi-ọ yạn kw'n'ayeri ajunung pọ bẹ́, abẹ akwu arima irima o?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika ubhina bẹ́, “Bẹ́ abạnga atạk akpatava p'ngwa, ọttạra ọfọhnẹja kwaam, atima afona. Bạnga ọttọhk vọ f'nkhaam adạkhẹ ọkhaama? Ukwuru yạn kw'abạnga n'abạbh-m bẹ́, ‘Udi-ọ yạn?’ ”<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Anạng p'Dan abhina bẹ́, Mạna abẹ udik kákhaanga, deja, ajunung bạnọ ma m'atima ottempyibh arima abọ, ọma ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chọ m'adimi akpen pabạnga udimi.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Ma wọ anạng p'Dan afon <char style="it">bẹ́ bẹẹm</char>. Masẹ Mika ose bẹ́ ajunung mbọ akhaam ẹfa ayọhng-ẹ, ọkpa nnạm ọbhạna.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Ma wọ abẹ atạk ekpo py'Mika kk'usia, ọttạra ọfọhnẹja kwẹ atima afona kha Laish, ata arima ekpong ọttạra anạng p'arukhu k'idira,p'nạn ojora nábạra akhaama. Abẹ atima ọkkangkkang-kkro arima anạng mbọ abẹ, abạra akkạmọ efhondiden chabẹ. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Wa ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'mọkkaana bẹ kòde, ukwuru s'ofhon kwabẹ ubhiri eden k'ofhon kw'Sidọn, ọttạra bẹ́, wa abẹ oforgbạkha ọttạra ofhon gwạnọ-gwạnọ n'nákhaama. Wa efhondiden njọ ining k'ipekhuma s'ibaang Bet-Rehob.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:28">Wa anạng p'Dan abạra asi efhondiden njọ aruk mạma. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Chibhi s'ode bẹ́, wa ofhon ngwọ okpen Laish, abẹ akpe kwẹ abhina Dan, kw'ode otte kwabẹ kwididen, kw'uwa ode nnwa kw'Jekọb. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Wa anạng p'Dan atạk ọkpatanwa attima, anạng abẹma oyeni; Jonatan kw'ode nnwa kw'Gershọm, kw'ode nnwa kw'Mosẹs, ọttạra ajunungva pẹ, ẹbọ p'uwa ade afọhnẹja p'ẹkhạma ch'Dan tạrr, ukpira k'okpe kw'abẹ avạk ẹkhạma njọ k'ẹmmạri. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Abẹ afon ororo n'akpobha ọkpatanwa nwọ kw'Mika kk'usia, k'okpe phyibh kw'ọchọhm kw'Ubinọkpaabyi uning kha Shilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ofona-nwa kw'Lẹvi ọttạra oyok kwẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />K'okpe ngwọ, wa anạng p'Israẹl ọvaanạng kákhaam.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 19:1">Ma o, ọkhaam ujunung wạnọ kw'efonamma ch'Lẹvi, kw'urukhu k'ẹtaanga-ẹtaanga kw'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Ephraim, kw'oyok kwẹ ubin Bẹtẹlẹhẹm k'Juda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Okhenkha, wa oyok nwọ kwẹ utim ọmmaana-pyibh utima otor-ẹ. Wa ubin urik udim ọkpa nnạm k'otte k'ọchọhm kha Bẹtẹlẹhẹm k'Juda. Masẹ kk'aphye annebung uninga kha, <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />udim ubin, ọtọhmnạng kwẹ abẹ, ọttạra nnyạnyaang sẹ mfa, bẹ́ ọta uchin-ẹ ọkpa nnạm. Mạnna wọ, ikwanạng nwọ utim udim ọnwa k'ọchọhm kw'otte. Masẹ otte kw'ikwanạng nwọ usiẹ-ẹ, orobh-ẹ k'ottennebh. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Ọnyẹ kwẹ kw'ode otte kw'ikwanạng nwọ, ophyem-ẹ bẹ́ ubhing bẹ abẹ, mạnna wọ ubhingi bẹ abẹ k'iwu ittaan, n'uchi ọbạra ogwo, ọbạra ọttaabha mạma.<verse eid="JDG 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Ottong iwu innebung, abẹ abin k'ekpekpebha ado ifor bẹ́, abẹ afona. Okhenkha, otte kw'ikwanạng nwọ oben udim kw'nnwa bẹ́, “Vạkha ẹfhạr bạrasẹ afona.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Mạnna wọ kw'abẹma ncho mfa achi uchiattọhk, abạra agwo atwuk. Masẹ abẹ kk'asa, otte kw'ikwanạng oben bẹ́, “Totokhạn, rebh ettem ninga mama ma k'irungu nja.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Okhenkha, k'okpe kw'ujunung nwọ ubin bẹ́ ofona, otte kw'ikwanạng nwọ oden-ẹ tạrr, ohema ma, uyima m'irungu njọ. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />K'ekpebha s'iwu echobh, ch'ettong iwu isen, masẹ ubin bẹ́ ofona, otte kw'ikwanạng nwọ oben bẹ́, “Vạkha ẹfhạr, aninga tạrr, ukpira k'ẹya!” Mạnna wọ abẹ atwạnọ achi ọttọhk.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Ma o, k'okpe kw'ujunung nwọ, ọttạra oyok kwẹ, ọttạra ọtọhmnạng kwẹ abin bẹ́, abẹ afona, ọnyẹ kwẹ kw'ode otte kw'oyok kw'ikwanạng, oben bẹ́, “Kkeri, iwu n'abạra ipyi e, chi ọttọhk ayima mama, khiri iwu kk'ẹsa. Rebh ettem ninga. Uphyini k'ekpekpebha, abina abhạna k'akhọ k'ọchọhm.” <verse eid="JDG 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Okhenkha, wa aro nwọ dạk kẹ nọ́daakha bẹ́ ọbạra uyima mạma k'irunguwu ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk. Wa odo nnyạnyaang sẹ ininga, utima oyok kwẹ ubina osenga ofona kha ukhubha kw'Jẹbus (kw'ode Jẹrusalẹm).<verse eid="JDG 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Masẹ abẹ kk'Jẹbus abaanga, s'iwu kk'ẹsa, ọtọhmnạng kw'ujunung nwọ oben aro kwẹ bẹ́, “Tte amming ma k'efhondiden ch'anạng p'Jẹbus ma irunguwu nja khadẹ o.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Aro kwẹ ubhina bẹ́, “Mma e, amạna k'efhondiden jạnẹ-jạnẹ ch'nạn ch'anạng p'Israẹl nídia mạ́nta. Uttu kw'm'ansi oche ngwọ m'antera anseng amfona kha Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Tte ankhonga amkpira kha Gibea, ọbạra ode Rama, ọfha anyima ma ofhon gwạnọ k'ifhon nnọ ifa.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Mạnna wọ abẹ afon ororo tạrr, ata abaanga Gibea k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, k'ẹchọhkha-ẹchọhkha. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Abẹ ata aseng k'Gibea k'oche kw'abẹ m'abhing ma irungu njọ. Abẹ afona ata aninga ẹyạr k'ẹbhama ch'efhondiden. Okhenkha, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'oyeri bẹ bẹ́, abẹ ata abhing k'akhẹ k'ọchọhm kòde.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Ma ẹchọhkha njọ, ọtạmanạng-junung wạnọ kw'ubin k'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Ephraim, uruk k'Gibea, ubin kha owonu kw'ọta usi ọtọhm ukwuna. Wa anạng p'Gibea p'uwa arukhu ma ibyi nnọ ade anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Okpe kw'ọtạmanạng nwọ udir achen okkeri kha ẹbhama, n'ọbạbhọ bẹ́, “Abạnga abin mạn? Abạnga n'atena njạn?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Ofona-nwa nwọ kw'Lẹvi, ubhina bẹ́, “Ambin kha Bẹtẹlẹhẹm kw'ẹkhạma ch'Juda, n'antena ẹttaanga-ẹttaanga kw'ukhubha kw'akpecho p'Ephraim, k'ibyi s'amma nnukhu. Wa nta kha Bẹtẹlẹhẹm k'ẹkhạma ch'Juda, mantọmma, n'abạra mfona k'ọchọhm kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'kk'aam utima bẹ́, nta mming k'akhẹ k'ibyi sẹ kòde. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Amạna ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ nánnora. Ankhaam asạsaarẹ-bukhu khakha, ọttạra uchiattọhk f'nnyạnyaang samạna m'ichi. Amạna mba atọhmnạng pọ antim brẹd ọttạra atwuk p'm'abenga amma, ọttạra oyok kwaam, ọttạra udikkobh-nwa kw'ọtwạnọ mạna abẹ.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Ọtạmanạng nwọ ọbẹ́, “Abạnga akwu aninga ka akhaam k'ọchọhm. Abạnga ma ẹbhama káninga. Amma m'nnạng bạnga fidede f'abạnga m'aror.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Mạnna wọ ọtạmanạng nwọ utim ujunung nwọ ofona k'akhẹ k'ọchọhm, ọbạra ọnạng nnyạnyaang sẹ uchiattọhk. Anạng mbọ akpobhu mfhokpatwạkhọ sabẹ, abẹ achi ọttọhk, abạra agwo atwuk.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Masẹ abẹ n'achi akpen o, abyibyia-nạng bạnọ p'efhondiden njọ abaabha ọchọhm ngwọ age ngekha, n'ammum ọbọhk k'ukhubh, akwọhrọ ọtạmanạng nwọ kw'ọkhaam ọchọhm ẹmạng bẹ́, “Tima ujunung nwọ kw'ọsạk ma k'akhọ k'ọchọhm yin ka iyaan, ọfha anyima abẹ.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Ma wọ oyeni-ọchọhm uyini k'iyaan oben ajunung mbọ bẹ́, “Mma e, ayok-udikkobh paam, abạnga ibyibyia demachẹ nja kási o. Masẹ ujunung nwa ode ukhikhennạng kwaam, abạnga ọgbạrsia-dik demakwẹ ngwa kási. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Akkeri, uminanwa kwaam ọttạra oyok kw'ujunung nwa aning mama. M'ntima bẹ nkkena bạnga ka iyaan, ọfha abạnga atima bẹ asi oche kw'abạnga akkẹ. De n'ode ujunung nwa, abạnga ọgbạrsia-dik ngwa mási.”<verse eid="JDG 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Okhenkha, ajunung mbọ ọtạmanạng nwọ itọhng nákhọma. Osenga ma, ofona-junung nwọ kw'Lẹvi ọtạkha oyok kwẹ ọnạng ajunung mbọ k'iyaan. Abẹ avạkh-ẹ k'ẹfa ayima abẹ ma irungu njọ kubungu. Masẹ iwu echobh, abẹ attiẹ-ẹ ọbọhk ofona. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Ma k'ekpekpebha, ikwanạng nwọ ọkpa nnạm ofona k'ọchọhm kw'aro kwẹ n'uninga, otto ma k'ẹttọhmma, uyima mạma tạrr, iwu ekkera ẹttaanẹ.<verse eid="JDG 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />K'okpe kw'aro kw'ikwanạng nwọ n'ọphyạbh k'ekpebha, ugwunga ukhubh k'oche kw'm'ofona ororo k'osenga kwẹ, n'ose s'oyok kwẹ kw'kk'utia ma k'ẹttọhmma, ọtạkha mbọhk ọvạkha k'ọmmakhubh. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Aro kwẹ oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Bina, amfona.” Okhenkha, ẹmạng núsia. Mạnna wọ ujunung nwọ udir-ẹ ọnạna k'ẹnyạnyaang, utima abẹ ọbhạna.<verse eid="JDG 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Masẹ abẹ akpir k'ọchọhm, ọtạkha okkro ọkpaara ikwanạng nwọ k'akhuma-k'akhuma k'ibyi jobhkamfa, ọtọhm ọnạng nkhạma jobhkamfa s'Israẹl. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Ọnạng kwidede kw'ose kwẹ n'ọbhạkhẹ oben oyok bẹ́, “Amạna udik demakwẹ ngwa tạm nánsia, ọnạng udik demakwẹ ngwa tạm núsia, tạma k'iwu ch'uwa anạng p'Israẹl abin k'Ijip. Udik kk'upyibha ro! Ọbaan bẹ́ anse udik antena mạma e!”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s1">Anạng p'Israẹl anạng anạng p'Bẹnjamin irem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl, tạma k'ẹkhạma ch'Dan tạrr, akpira k'Beershẹba, akwu attạra ẹkhạma ch'Gilead, afona ata agba masẹ anạng bạnọ kha Mizpa, k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Wa adecho phyibh p'nkhạma s'anọng p'Israẹl atạk nninga sabẹ, k'ininga ch'anạng p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi p'ade anạng nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh p'adạbhẹ ekpong-kpo, akkangkkang-kkro abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />(Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin abhaang bẹ́ anạng p'Israẹl kk'avura ata atobha kha Mizpa.) Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl abeni bẹ́, “Abạnga akpaak mạna oche kw'ibyibyia-khira nja eseng etto.”<verse eid="JDG 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Osenga ma, ujunung nwọ kw'efonamma ch'Lẹvi, kw'ode udim kw'ikwanạng nwọ kw'abẹ afhọ, oben bẹ́, “Amma ọttạra oyok kwaam wa ankwu k'Gibea k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin bẹ́, amming mạma k'irungu. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Ma irungu njọ, ajunung p'abin ma Gibea akhubh-m, akwu abaabha ọchọhm kw'nning age ngekha, bẹ́ abẹ m'afhọ-m. Abẹ ayima oyok kwaam abẹ k'ẹfa tạrr, ope. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Akwẹma gwọ usi, ntạkha oyok nwọ kwaam mkpaara k'akhuma-k'akhuma, ntạkha ikhuma k'arạnẹ-k'arạnẹ ntọhm k'ẹkhạma chidede ch'Israẹl ọkhaam okhebh, ukwuru bẹ́, mạma k'Israẹl wọ kw'abẹ aning asi ubyibyia-dik ngwọ, ọttạra ọkpạrsia-dik ngwọ. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Ma o, abạnga ma oyeni anạng p'Israẹl phyi-phyibh, atekh-m oche kw'abạnga kk'attọhna bẹ́ abạnga m'asi e.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Mạnna wọ kw'ajunung phyi-phyibh abin akhaama ẹkka jạnẹ, aben bẹ́, “Ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ ma k'ikhaana s'amạna kw'm'ọbhạna k'akhẹ k'ọchọhm kòde. K'udik-ọkka, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'm'ọbhạna k'akhẹ k'ọchọhm kòde. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Kkeri udik kw'm'ansi anạng p'Gibea: M'anta annima bẹ́ abẹ antor k'oche kw'ẹyaakha ch'ọsẹ, ede. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />M'annengi ajunung jobh k'ikhaana s'ajunung arạbh asen k'ẹkhạma chidede ch'Israẹl. M'annengi ajunung arạbh asen k'ikhaana s'ajunung nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh pidede. M'annengi ajunung nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh k'ikhaana s'ajunung ẹrạbh ukuma asen, abẹma mbọ bạra n'aror uchiattọhk f'arimekpong m'n'achi. Masẹ arimekpong akpir k'Gibea k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, abẹ anạngẹ anạng p'Gibea irem s'ibaanẹ bẹ, k'ubyibyia-dik ngwọ kw'abẹ asi k'Israẹl.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Israẹl phyibh akhaam echera jạnẹ masẹ anạng bạnọ, ata arima anạng p'efhondiden njọ abẹ.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Wa anạng p'nkhạma s'anạng p'Israẹl atọhmọ akpaakh-nkkaabha abaabha ekhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, aben bẹ́, “Bạng ubyibyia-dik demakwẹ gwọ kw'abạnga asi ma ikhaana sabạnga mama o? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Abạnga anạng mạna agbannạng mbọ p'abin Gibea, ọfha amfhọ bẹ, ọfha asenga ma amkpobhu ibyibyia nja k'Israẹl ammạrẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:13">Okhenkha, anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin abẹ ayok-ofhon p'Israẹl itọhng nákhọma. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin abin k'ifhon sabẹ ata atobha k'Gibea bẹ́, abẹ arima anạng p'Israẹl abẹ. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Benjamin annemi eden arengi ajunung k'ifhon sabẹ, p'n'atima akkangkkang-kkro arima ekpong, anạng nnọhna arạbh attaan ukuma asen, akwu attạra k'adikkobh nnọhna nnọhna nnebung ukuma arạbh asenọfa ukuma jobh, p'akhaam ẹfa, p'abạra aruk k'Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />K'ikhaana s'arimekpong mbọ phyibh, wa abẹ arengi anạng ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh chi p'asi ibhiribọhk, p'abạra atena ọbọhk k'ẹta-bhạra. Ọnạng kw'n'ọbhạrẹ ẹta bẹ́ ọtọhbh usisira-naanga kw'upini kòde.<verse eid="JDG 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />De akpẹrẹ anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin ajẹ, wa anạng p'Israẹl atobh anạng nnọhna-nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh p'n'atima ọkkangkkang-kkro arima ekpong, abẹma mbọ phyibh akhaam ekkoji ch'ekpong.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl asengi atena kha Bẹtẹl ata adwạn Ubinọkpaabyi. Abẹ aben bẹ́, “Bạng ẹkhạma ma k'ngekha kwamạna jọ m'ichi eden ẹta irima anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin abẹ o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhin bẹ́, “Ẹkhạma ch'Juda ẹjọ m'ichi eden.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />K'ekpebha s'iwu echobh, anạng p'Israẹl ata attima ibyibhingasẹ abaanga Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl ata arima anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin abẹ, abẹ ata abe atik bẹ k'Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Wa anạng p'Bẹnjanin abin k'Gibea ma iwu njọ, ata afhọ anạng p'Israẹl nnọhna arạbh afa ukuma chi k'akpong-chen. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Okhenkha, wa anạng p'Israẹl age ayok nttem, abạra ata abe atik k'ibyi s'uwa abẹ arim ekpong k'echedenwu. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl avur k'ikpukpobhabyi ata agạma ayeri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi tạrr, ukpira k'ẹchọhkha aben bẹ́, “Ambạra anta annima adạkhẹ anạng p'Bẹjamin p'ade ayok-ofhon pamạna abẹ yeri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhina bẹ́, “Abạnga asọhng ata arima bẹ abẹ.”<verse eid="JDG 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Mạnna wọ kw'anạng p'Israẹl atwạkhọ agbara ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin k'iwu ch'ettong ifa. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Ẹkpa nja, ajunung p'Bẹnjamin ayini k'Gibea akwu arima anạng p'Israẹl abẹ, abẹ afhọ anạng p'Israẹl nnọhna arạbh afa ukuma asen. Anạng p'abẹ afhọ phyi-phyibh ade anạng p'n'atima akkangkkang-kkro arima ekpong.<verse eid="JDG 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl phyibh ọttạra arimekpong phyibh avur atena kha Bẹtẹl, ata aninga ẹyạr kạkha n'agạma ayeri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Abẹ ayima okwo ma iwu njọ tạrr, ukpira k'ẹchọhkha. Abẹ asi nnạnga ikạmasẹ ọttạra nnạnga s'idira anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl adwạn Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. (Ma okpe ngwọ, wa Ikwukwur s'Echekha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ining mạma, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Phinẹhas kw'ode nnwa kw'Eleaza, ọttạra ujunungnwa kw'Aarọn ẹbọ p'uwa ade atọhmnạng mạma). Wa abẹ abạbhọ bẹ́, “Ambạra anta annima anạng p'Bẹnjamin p'ade ayok-ofhon pamạna abẹ saa, nạngẹ anta?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhin bẹ́, “Abạng asọhng, khiri uphyini m'ntạkha bẹ ọtạkha nge bạnga k'mbọhk.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Israẹl ata abaabha Gibea age ngekha. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl avur ata arima ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin abẹ, ottong iwu ittaan. Abẹ ata abe atik k'Gibea k'oche kw'uwa abẹ kk'asia. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin abin akwu arima anạng p'Israẹl abẹ, anạng p'Israẹl atwạn bẹ abẹ abina k'efhondiden. Abẹ atạma anạng p'Israẹl mmena nạnạng k'oche kw'uwa abẹ n'asi bẹ tạrr, abẹ afhọ ajunung arạbh ukuma jobh k'iwonu ọttạra k'akkaden. Wa eden jạnẹ eten k'Bẹtẹl, njọkha etena k'Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Masẹ anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin n'aben bẹ́, “M'ankhema bẹ oche kw'uwa n'antto-otto ankhema bẹ.” Anạng p'Israẹl n'aben bẹ́, “Tte antwạr bẹ antima abina k'efhondiden anyin k'ọkkaden.”<verse eid="JDG 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Wa ajunung p'Israẹl phyibh abin k'ibyi s'abẹ abe, ata abe kha Baal-Tamar. Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl abin k'ibyi s'abẹ attubh, akwu ukhubha kw'ọchọhkhadudon ayin kha. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Osenga ma, adikkọbh p'Israẹl p'akhaam ẹfa, anạng nnọhna ẹrạbh ukuma asen, akwu arima Gibea abẹ ititikha ọttạra ititikha. Wa irima njọ ẹkpọhkhọ tạrr, anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin utum nágia bẹ́, idima chabẹ, ẹjọ ch'n'ikwu mạma. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi okhem anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin ma k'ititikha s'anạng p'Israẹl. Ma iwu njọ, anạng p'Israẹl afhọ anạng p'Bẹjamin nnọhna arạbh attaan ukuma jobhkanttaan. Wa anạng p'abẹ afhọ phyi-phyibh ade anạng p'n'atima akkangkkang-kkro arima ekpong. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin n'akwu ase bẹ́, abẹ kk'bẹ akhema.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Wa anạng p'Israẹl kk'abina arik anạng p'Bẹjamin, ukwuru bẹ wa abẹ aphye nnạm k'anạng p'kk'ata attubha atik kha ọbaanga Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Wa ajunung p'attubh atik abin ma k'ẹbhạr-k'ẹbhạr anwa k'Gibea, abẹ anyaamẹ, atima akkangkkang-kkro afhọ anạng k'efhondiden phyibh. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />N'ode s'uwa anạng p'Israẹl kk'nttọhna akhaama ọttạra anạng p'attubh atik bẹ́, abẹ asi isusong k'efhondiden s'm'ivura k'ẹrạng-k'ẹrạng, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />ọfha anạng p'Israẹl abhạkhẹ bẹ abẹ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:39">Wa anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin kk'anạng p'Israẹl ekpo atạma sisi (abẹ afhọ anạng-nạbh ukuma jobh), aben bẹ́, “M'ankhema bẹ oche ngwọ kw'ocheden-kpe.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Okpe kw'uwa isusong n'itạm k'ẹrạng-k'ẹrạng vu-vura k'efhondiden, anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin n'abhạkhẹ ase isusong s'n'ivura k'ẹrạng ibaabha efhondiden kubungu. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Osenga ma, anạng p'Israẹl abhạkhẹ anạng p'ekhạma ch'Bẹnjamin abẹ. Wa ojora ọvạkha anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, s'uwa abẹ atini bẹ́, ipyibha kk'ittia ikhebha bẹ. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Ma wọ, anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin arạbhọ ma ititikha s'anạng p'Israẹl, aseng k'ukhubha kw'anạng n'nárukha, okhenka, abẹ ekpong njọ nákkia arạbh annaanga. Mạnna wọ kw'anạng p'Israẹl p'ayini ma ifhon nnọ afhọ bẹ mạma. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl abaabh anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin age ngekha, abẹ akhubh bẹ, ata akhạbha bẹ oro, kha ukhubha kw'okpebhadudon kha Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Wa anạng nnọhna arạbh afa ukuma nnọhna nsen p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin ẹbọ ape. Wa anạng p'ape phyi-phyibh ade akkenkpa. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Masẹ ajunung p'Bẹnjamin p'arikhi-urik abhạkhẹ nnạm arạbh afona k'ukhubha kw'uminkpa kha ẹtakpa ch'Rimọn, anạng p'Israẹl afhọ ajunung nnọhna jobhkamfa ukuma arạbh jobh k'ọkkaden. Abẹ afon ororo akhubh anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin tạrr, abẹ akpira k'Gidom, abẹ abạra afhọ anạng nnọhna nsen.<verse eid="JDG 20:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Ma iwu njọ, ajunung p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin nnọhna arạbh attaan ukuma nnọhna mfa ukuma arạbh jobh p'n'atima akkangkkang-kkro arima ekpong ẹbọ p'ape. Wa anạng mbọ phyibh p'ape ade akkenkpa. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Okhenkha, wa anạng ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jọbh, arạbhọ atena k'ibyi s'anạng n'nạrukha kha ẹtakpa ch'Rimọn, abẹ aninga mạma k'aphye annebung. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Osenga ma, ajunung p'Israẹl akpa nnạm k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, ata atima ọkkangkkang-kkro afhọ anạng p'ifhọn nnọ phyibh, ọttạra itirakpo, ọttạra ọttọhk fidede f'abẹ ase. Abẹ age ofhon kwidede kw'abẹ ase ekpon.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s1">Anạng p'Israẹl anạngẹ ajunung p'Bẹnjamin ipanạng pabẹ k'ọbada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Wa ajunung p'Israẹl kk'echekha atạkha k'Mizpa bẹ́, “Amạna mba aminava pamạna mántạkha annạng ujunung wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin k'ọbada.”<verse eid="JDG 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Wa anạng mbọ afon kha Bẹtẹl, ata aninga ẹyạr k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, n'agạma k'ottempyibh k'ẹrạng-k'ẹrạng tạrr, iwu ekhebha ma, ẹsa. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Abẹ agạm aben bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl, k'ayạn kw'udik demakwẹ ngwa otto Israẹl o? K'ayạn kw'n'ode bẹ́, ẹkhạma jạnẹ ch'Israẹl kk'idima k'amạna k'ikhaana o!”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />K'ekpekpebha s'iwu echobh, anạng mbọ asi ijabyi rạnẹ s'abẹ aning asi nnạnga ikạmasẹ ọttạra nnạnga s'ẹmẹm.<verse eid="JDG 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl abạbhọ bẹ́, “Bạng ẹkhạma ch'Israẹl k'amạna k'ngekha jọ ch'nạn mạna abẹ nétwạna k'okpe kw'wạra antobh k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kha Mizpa?” N'ode s'abẹ kk'echekha atạkha bạra k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, ọnạng kwidede kw'ufhumu kwu-kwu, abẹ m'afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="JDG 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl akhaam ikwosi-ttem atena anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, p'ade ivotte pabẹ, aben bẹ́, “Ẹkhạma jạnẹ k'nkhạma s'Israẹl kk'idima chemma e. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />M'ansenga yạn annor ipanạng p'm'annạng ayok mbọ p'arikhi-urik, s'kk'echekha antạkha k'eche ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, amạna bẹ aminava pamạna k'ọbaada mánnạng o?” <verse eid="JDG 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Ma wọ, abẹ n'abạbhọ bẹ́, “Bạng ẹkhạma ch'Israẹl jọ ch'nạn mạna abẹ nẹ́twạna k'okpe kw'antobh k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kha Mizpa?” Wa abẹ akwu atin bẹ́, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ubin Jabẹsh-Gilead kw'ọta etobha njọ kòde. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Masẹ abẹ kk'anạng abhikha bẹ phyibh, abẹ akwu ase bẹ́, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ubin k'Jabẹsh Gilead kòde.<verse eid="JDG 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Ma wọ abẹ atọhmọ akkemkpa pabẹ, anạng nnọhna arạbh ukuma jobh k'Jabẹsh-Gilead, atọhn bẹ bẹ́, abẹ afhọ ọnạng kwidede, abạr-ọbạr asạkha-ọsạkha. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />“Abẹ ben bẹ́,“Mama wọ ode udik kw'abạnga m'asi, abạnga m'afhọ ajunung phyibh ọttạra ikwanạng kwidede kw'kk'ujunung osonga.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Masẹ abẹ akpir k'Jabẹsh-Gilead, abẹ ase aminava ẹnọhna p'nạn ibyi s'ujunung tạm násonga, abẹ atima bẹ afona k'ibyibhingasẹ kha Shilo, k'ẹkhạma ch'Kenaan.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl atọhmọ ẹkkaabha ch'ẹmẹm akkena anạng p'arikhi k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin p'uwa arukhu k'ẹtakpa ch'Rimọn. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Ma o, anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Benjamin akpa nnạm abhạna k'abẹ k'ichọhm. Abẹ atạkha aminava mbọ ẹnọhna p'Jabesh-Gilead p'uwa abẹ n'náfha, anạng ajunung mbọ, aba. Okhenkha, wa aminava mbọ ajunung mbọ phyibh nágba.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Wa anạng mbọ akhaam ikwosi atena ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin, ukwuru s'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ẹbhaangẹ ugia k'nkhạma s'Israẹl. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Osenga ma, adennạng p'etobha njọ n'abạbhọ bẹ́, “Masẹ abẹ kk'ipanạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin afha phyibh, m'ansenga yạn annor ipanạng p'm'annạng ajunung p'arikh-urik o? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Ọbaan bẹ́ anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin akhaama iva p'm'atera echo ch'anạng p'arikh-urik, ọfha abẹ nạng ẹkhạma jạnẹ ch'Israẹl adimi. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Bẹ aminava pamạna k'ọbaada mánnạng, ukwuru echekha ch'amạna mba anạng p'Israẹl kk'antạkha bẹ́: ‘Tte ẹmma ẹraakhẹ ọnạng kwidede kw'ọnạngẹ ujunung kw'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin ikwanạng ọba.’ <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Akker o, erobha ch'icho kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning k'Shilo, kw'uning k'ibira-ibira kw'Bẹtẹl, k'ukhubha kw'okpebhadudon n'uyin, kha eden ch'eten k'Bẹtẹl ọttạra k'Shẹkẹm, ọttạra k'ẹrạkha-ẹrạkha kw'Lẹbona.”<verse eid="JDG 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Wa abẹ anạngẹ anạng p'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin ntọhna aben bẹ́, “Abạnga asọhng ata attubha k'iwonu s'grep <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />atik. Masẹ aminava p'Shilo m'ayin kha bẹ́, abẹ akwu attạra k'ọkhaana kw'utubha, tte ọnạng-ọnạng onemi eden uyin k'iwonu s'grep, ukwu ọvạkha uminanwa wạnọ kw'm'utima usi ikwanạng kwẹ. Abạnga akpa nnạm abhạna k'ẹkhạma ch'Bẹnjamin. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Ode ab'otte ọttạra iv'otte pabẹ ajọhmọ bạnga anạngẹ mạna, m'antek bẹ bẹ́, ‘Abạng asi mạna ọphyaam akkaana bẹ, ukwuru bẹ́, wa bẹ ipanạng nánnạnga k'okpe kw'ekpong. Abạnga oponga-pyibh kw'echekha ttạtto mákhaama, ukwuru s'uwa abạnga nạn bẹ aminava pabạnga nánạnga.”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Mạnna wọ wa ajunung p'Bẹjamin asi. Masẹ aminava mbọ n'atubh ibin, ujunung kwidede ọvạk uminanwa wạnọ utima usi ikwanạng kwẹ. Wa abẹ akpa nnạm abhạna k'isisek s'ide okhebh pfabẹ, abẹ bạra ado ifhon sabẹ, aruk mạma.<verse eid="JDG 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Ma okpe ngwọ, anạng p'Israẹl ayaangẹ ibyi nnọ ajẹ, abhạna kha nkhạma, ọttạra kha innạmma sabẹ, ọnạng-ọnạng k'okhebh pfẹ.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl ọvaarnạng ma okpe ngwọ kàkhaam, ọnạng kwidede urukhu akpen k'oche kw'ọdaakh-ẹ.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>